<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">II Kwonik Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">DEZYÈM LIV KWONIK YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">II Kwonik Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">II Kwo</para>
  <para style="mt1">II KWONIK YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12-46">I Wa 2:12-46</ref></char></note>Salomon, fis a David la te etabli li menm byen solid sou wayòm li an. SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, te avèk li e Li te egzalte li anpil.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Salomon te pale a tout Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:1">I Kwo 28:1</ref></char></note>a kòmandan a dè milye yo e dè santèn yo, a jij yo e tout moun nan sila ki t ap dirije nan tout Israël yo, chèf lakay zansèt pa yo. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Konsa, Salomon avèk tout asanble a avèk li menm te monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:4">I Wa 3:4</ref></char></note>wo plas ki te Gabaon an; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 36:8">Egz 36:8</ref></char></note>tant asanble a Bondye ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te fè nan dezè a, te la. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Sepandan, David te gen tan mennen fè monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:25-28">I Kwo 15:25-28</ref></char></note>lach Bondye a soti Kirjath-Jearim nan plas li te prepare pou li. Paske li te fè monte yon tant pou li Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:9">Egz 31:9</ref></char></note>lotèl an bwonz ke Betsaleel, fis a Uri a, te fè a te la devan tabènak SENYÈ a, e Salomon avèk asanble a te chache jwenn li. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Salomon te monte la devan SENYÈ a kote lotèl an bwonz nan tant asanble a, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:4">I Wa 3:4</ref></char></note>ofri yon mil ofrann brile sou li.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:5-14">I Wa 3:5-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan lannwit, Bondye te parèt a Salomon. Li te di l: “Mande M sa pou M ta ba ou.”<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Salomon te reponn a Bondye: “Ou te aji avèk papa m David avèk anpil lanmou dous, e Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:5">I Kwo 28:5</ref></char></note>te fè m wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Koulye a, O SENYÈ Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">II Sam 7:12-16</ref></char></note>Sa Ou te pwomèt a papa m nan, David, akonpli. Paske Ou te fè m wa sou yon pèp ki gran an kantite tankou pousyè latè. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:9">I Wa 3:9</ref></char></note>Koulye a, ban mwen sajès avèk konesans, pou m kab antre sòti devan pèp sa a, paske se kilès ki kab gouvène gran pèp Ou sa a?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:11">I Wa 3:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye te di a Salomon: “Akoz ou te gen sa nan tèt ou e ou pa t mande richès, ni byen, ni lonè, ni lavi a sila ki rayi ou yo, ni ou pa t menm mande pou yon vi long, men ou te mande pou kont ou sajès pou ou ta kab gouvène pèp Mwen an, sou sila Mwen te fè ou wa a, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />sajès avèk konesans gen tan bay a ou menm. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:25">I Kwo 29:25</ref></char></note>Mwen va ba ou richès avèk byen, avèk lonè, tankou okenn nan wa avan ou yo pa t janmen genyen, ni sila ki va swiv ou yo.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 1:3">II Kwo 1:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Salomon te sòti nan kote wo ki te Gabaon an, li te soti nan tant asanble a, pou rive Jérusalem; e li te renye sou tout Israël.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">I Wa 10:26-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salomon te vin gen cha avèk chevalye. Li te gen mil-kat-san cha avèk douz-mil chevalye e li te estasyone yo nan vil cha yo epi ak wa a nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:27">I Wa 10:27</ref></char></note>Wa a te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Det 17:17</ref></char></note>ajan avèk lò vin an kantite Jérusalem, menm jan avèk wòch, e li te fè bwa sèd vin anpil tankou bwa sikomò nan ba plèn nan. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Det 17:16</ref></char></note>Cheval Salomon yo te enpòte soti an Égypte ak Kue. Komèsan a wa yo te achte yo nan Kue. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Yo te enpòte cha yo soti an Égypte pou sis-san sik ajan chak, cheval yo pou san-senkant chak, e pa menm mwayen an, yo te fè distribisyon a tout wa Etyen yo avèk wa Siryen yo.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 5:5">I Wa 5:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Salomon te deside bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a ak yon palè wayal pou pwòp tèt li. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:15-16">I Wa 5:15-16</ref></char></note> Salomon te chwazi swasann-di-mil mesye pou pote chaj, katreven-mil mesye pou taye wòch nan mòn yo, e twa-mil-sis-san pou sipèvize.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 5:2-11">I Wa 5:2-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Salomon te voye kote Huram, wa Tyr la. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 14:1">I Kwo 14:1</ref> </char></note>“Jan ou te aji avèk David la, papa m nan, Ou te voye ba li bwa sèd pou bati yon kay pou li ta rete ladann. Konsa, fè sa pou mwen. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Gade byen, mwen prè pou bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye a, pou l dedye a Li menm, pou brile lansan santi bon devan L, pou plase pen konsakre tout tan e pou ofri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38-42">Egz 29:38-42</ref></char></note>ofrann brile ni nan maten, ni nan aswè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Nonb 28:9-10</ref></char></note>nan Saba avèk nouvèl lin ak nan fèt etabli a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, sila kòm egzije jis pou tout tan an Israël.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />“Kay ke m prè pou bati a va tèlman gran; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Egz 15:11</ref></char></note>pi gran se Bondye pa nou an, ke tout lòt dye yo. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Men se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">I Wa 8:27</ref></char></note>kilès ki kab bati yon kay pou Li, paske syèl yo avèk pi wo syèl yo pa kab kenbe Li? Pou sa, se kilès mwen ye, pou mwen ta dwe bati yon kay pou Li, sof ke pou brile lansan devan L.<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />“Alò, voye ban mwen yon nonm abil pou travay an lò, ajan, bwonz, fè ak an twal mov, kramwazi, avèk vyolèt e yon nonm ki konn grave, pou travay avèk mesye kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:15">I Kwo 22:15</ref></char></note>ke m genyen Juda avèk Jérusalem, ke papa m, David te chwazi yo.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />“Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:6">I Wa 5:6</ref></char></note>voye ban mwen bwa sèd, bwa sipre, avèk bwa sandal; twòn yo k ap sòti nan Liban, paske mwen konnen ke sèvitè ou yo konnen jan pou yo koupe bwa Liban yo. Èpi anverite, sèvitè mwen yo va travay avèk sèvitè pa w yo, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />pou prepare bwa konstriksyon pou mwen an gran kantite. Pwiske kay ke mwen prè pou bati a va yon gran mèvèy. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Alò, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:11">I Wa 5:11</ref></char></note>mwen va bay a sèvitè ou yo, mesye forè ki koupe bwa konstriksyon yo, ven-mil barik ble kraze ven-mil barik lòj, ven-mil galon diven avèk ven-mil galon lwil.”<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Huram, wa Tyr la, te reponn nan yon lèt voye bay Salomon: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:9">I Wa 10:9</ref></char></note>“Akoz SENYÈ a renmen pèp Li a, Li te fè ou wa sou yo.” <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Konsa, Huram te kontinye: “Beni se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:6">Sòm 33:6</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, ki te fè syèl la avèk tè a, ki te bay Wa David yon fis ki saj, plen avèk pridans, avèk bon konprann, ki va bati yon kay pou SENYÈ a, avèk yon palè wayal pou li menm.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />“Alò, mwen ap voye Huramabi, yon nonm abil avèk anpil bon konprann, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:14">I Wa 7:14</ref></char></note>fis a yon fanm a Dan avèk yon papa a Tyriens, ki konnen jan pou travay an lò, ajan, bwonz, fè, wòch ak bwa; anplis, avèk twal mov, vyolèt, materyo wouj, pou fè tout kalite bagay grave yo, pou swiv nenpòt plan ke li resevwa, pou travay avèk mesye a kapasite pa w yo, avèk sila a mèt mwen, ak papa ou, David.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />“Alò, pou sa, kite mèt mwen an voye kote sèvitè li yo ble avèk lòj, lwil ak diven <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:10">II Kwo 2:10</ref></char></note>sou sa li te pale yo. <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:8-9">I Wa 5:8-9</ref></char></note>Nou va koupe nenpòt bwa konstriksyon ke ou bezwen soti nan Liban pou pote ba ou ranje mare ansanm sou lanmè pou rive Japho, pou ou kab pote l monte Jérusalem.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Salomon te fè kontwòl a tout etranje ki te nan peyi Israël yo, pou swiv gran kontwòl ke papa li, David te fè a; epi yo te jwenn san-senkant-twa-mil-sis-san moun. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:2">II Kwo 2:2</ref></char></note>Li te chwazi swasann-di-mil nan yo pou pote chaj yo, katreven mil nan yo pou taye wòch nan mòn yo e twa-mil-sis-san sipèvizè pou fè moun yo travay.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:1">I Wa 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Salomon te kòmanse bati lakay SENYÈ a Jérusalem sou Mòn Moriah, kote SENYÈ a te parèt a papa li a, David, nan plas ke David te prepare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 21:8">I Kwo 21:8</ref></char></note>sou glasi vannen ki te pou Ornan, Jebizyen an. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Li te kòmanse bati nan dezyèm jou, nan dezyèm mwa nan katriyèm ane règn pa li a. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Alò, sila yo se fondasyon ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:2">I Wa 6:2</ref></char></note>Salomon te poze pou konstriksyon kay Bondye a. Longè a an koude, selon mezi ansyen an te swasant koude e lajè a te ven koude. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Galri ki te devan kay la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:3">I Wa 6:3</ref></char></note>menm longè avèk lajè kay la, ven koude e wotè a san-ven. Pa anndan li te kouvri kay la avèk yon kouch lò pi. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Li te kouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:17">I Wa 6:17</ref></char></note>gran chanm nan avèk bwa sipre. Li te fè kouvri li ak lò fen e te dekore li avèk pye palmis avèk chenn. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Anplis, li te dekore kay la avèk pyè presye. Lò a te lò sòti Parvaïm. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:20-22">I Wa 6:20-22</ref> </char></note>li te kouvri kay la avèk yon kouch lò—travès yo, chanbrann yo, mi li yo, avèk pòtay li yo, epi li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:29-35">I Wa 6:29-35</ref> </char></note>grave cheriben yo sou mi yo.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Alò, li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33">Egz 26:33</ref></char></note>chanm ki pi sen pase tout lòt yo. Longè li ki te travèse lajè kay la, te ven koude, e lajè li te ven koude. Li te kouvri li avèk lò fen, ki te rive jis nan sis-san talan lò. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Pwa a klou yo te senkant sik an lò. Anplis, li te kouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:11">I Kwo 28:11</ref></char></note>chanm anlè yo avèk lò.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Li te fè de cheriben skilpte nan chanm ki sen pase tout lòt yo a e li te kouvri yo avèk lò. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Distans zèl ouvri pou de cheriben yo te ven koude. Zèl a youn te fè senk koude pou touche mi kay la e lòt zèl la senk koude te touche pwent zèl a lòt cheriben an. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Zèl a lòt cheriben an, a senk koude, te touche mi kay la, epi lòt zèl senk koude a te tache a zèl premye cheriben an. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Zèl a cheriben sila yo te lonje pou ven koude, e yo te kanpe sou pye yo avèk fas yo vè gran chanm nan. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Li te fè vwal la avèk len vyolèt, mov, wouj, e li te fè desen cheriben yo sou li.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Anplis, li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15-20">I Wa 7:15-20</ref> </char></note>de pilye pou devan kay la, trann-senk koude nan wotè e tèt anlè a sou chak te senk koude. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Li te fè chenn nan sanktyè enteryè a. Li te plase yo sou tèt pilye yo. Li te fè san grenad e te mete yo sou chenn yo. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:21">I Wa 7:21</ref></char></note>Li te leve pilye yo pa devan tanp lan, youn adwat e lòt la agoch, epi li te rele sila adwat la Jakin e sila agoch la Boaz.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Apre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:1-2">Egz 27:1-2</ref></char></note>li te fè yon lotèl an bwonz, ven koude nan longè, ven koude nan lajè ak dis koude nan wotè. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-26">I Wa 7:23-26</ref></char></note>Anplis, li te fè yon lanmè an fè fòje, dis koude de lajè, tou won, wotè li te senk koude e sikonferans lan te trant koude. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Yon estati sanblab a bèf yo te anba li, e te antoure li, dis koude, ki te antoure lanmè a nèt. Bèf yo te an de ranje, e yo te fòje yo tankou yon sèl pyès. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Lanmè a te kanpe sou douz bèf, twa avèk fas yo vè nò, twa avèk fas yo vè lwès, twa avèk fas yo vè sid, e twa avèk fas yo vè lès. Epi lanmè li te poze sou yo, e dèyè a tout bèt te pozisyone pa anndan. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Li te gen episè a yon men ouvri, epi rebò li te fèt tankou sila a yon tas, tankou yon flè lis k ap ouvri. Li te resevwa e te kenbe volim a twa-mil bat. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Egz 30:17-21</ref></char></note>li te fè dis basen kote pou lave e li te pozisyone senk sou kote dwat la e senk sou kote goch la pou lave bagay pou ofrann brile yo. Men lanmè a te pou prèt yo ta kab lave ladann.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Egz 25:31-40</ref></char></note>dis chandelye an lò selon òdonans ki te etabli yo e li te plase yo nan tanp lan, senk sou bò dwat la e senk sou bò goch la. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Anplis, li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:48">I Wa 7:48</ref></char></note>dis tab e te plase yo nan tanp lan, senk sou kote dwat la e senk sou kote goch la. Epi li te fè san bòl an lò. <verse eid="2CH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">I Wa 6:36</ref></char></note>lakou prèt yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:5">II Wa 21:5</ref></char></note>gran lakou a avèk pòt pou lakou a, e li te kouvri pòt yo avèk bwonz. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:39">I Wa 7:39</ref></char></note>Li te pozisyone lanmè a sou kote dwat kay la vè sidès.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:40-51">I Wa 7:40-51</ref></char></note>Huram te fè bokit sann yo, pèl ak bòl yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Konsa, Huram te fin fè travay ke li te fè pou Salomon lakay Bondye a: <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />de pilye yo, bòl yo, de gran tèt pilye sou pilye yo ak de sistèm griyaj treyi yo pou kouvri de bòl a tèt pilye ki te chita sou pilye yo, <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:20">I Wa 7:20</ref></char></note>kat-san grenad pou de sistèm griyaj yo, de ranje grenad pou chak sistèm griyaj pou kouvri de tèt pilye ki te sou pilye yo. <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:27-43">I Wa 7:27-43</ref></char></note>Anplis, li te fè baz ak basen sou baz yo, <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />ak yon sèl lanmè avèk douz bèf yo anba li. <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />Bokit yo, pèl yo, fouchèt yo ak tout zouti li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:14">I Wa 7:14</ref></char></note>Huram te fè yo avèk bwonz poli pou wa Salomon pou kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Nan plèn Jourdain an, Wa a te fonn yo nan tè ajil ki te antre Succoth avèk Tseréda a. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:47">I Wa 7:47</ref></char></note>Konsa, Salomon te fè tout zouti sila yo an gran kantite, jis pwa a bwonz lan pa t kab detèmine.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Anplis, Salomon te fè tout bagay ki te nan kay Bondye a: lotèl an lò a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:8">II Kwo 4:8</ref></char></note>tab yo avèk pen prezans lan sou yo, <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />chandelye yo avèk lanp pa yo an lò pi, pou briye devan sanktyè enteryè a jan sa te òdone a; <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />flè yo, lanp yo ak pens dife yo an lò byen rafine nèt; <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />epi etennwa yo, bòl yo, kiyè yo, ak plato sann an lò rafine yo, epi antre kay la, pòt enteryè li yo pou kote ki pi sen pase tout lòt yo a, ak pòt kay yo, sa vle di, kote gwo sanktyè a te ye a, tout te an lò.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:51">I Wa 7:51</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, tout travay ke Salomon te acheve pou kay SENYÈ a te fini. Epi Salomon te mennen fè antre tout bagay ke David, papa li, te dedye yo, menm ajan avèk lò a, tout zouti yo e li te mete yo nan trezò lakay Bondye a.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:1-9">I Wa 8:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre, Salomon te rasanble nan Jérusalem ansyen Israël yo, ak tout chèf a tribi yo, chèf lakay papa zansèt a fis Israël yo, pou mennen fè monte lach SENYÈ a sòti andeyò vil David la, ki se Sion. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:2">I Wa 8:2</ref></char></note>Tout mesye Israël yo te rasanble yo kote wa a nan fèt ki te nan setyèm mwa a. <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Konsa, tout ansyen Israël yo te vini. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:6">Jos 3:6</ref></char></note>Levit yo te leve pran lach la. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />Yo te mennen lach la fè l monte avèk tant asanble a ak tout zouti sen ki te nan tant yo. Prèt Levit yo te mennen fè yo monte. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Epi Wa Salomon avèk tout asanble Israël ki te rasanble avèk li devan lach yo, t ap fè sakrifis a yon tèlman gran kantite mouton avèk bèf ke yo pa t kab kontwole ni konte. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Answit, prèt yo te mennen lach akò a SENYÈ a antre nan plas li, anndan sanktyè enteryè kay la, nan kote ki sen pase tout lòt yo anba zèl a cheriben yo. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Paske cheriben yo te lonje zèl yo sou plas lach la, jiskaske cheriben yo te fè yon kouvèti sou lach la avèk poto li yo. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Poto yo te tèlman long ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:8-9">I Wa 8:8-9</ref></char></note>pwent poto a lach yo te vizib devan sanktyè enteryè a, men yo pa t kab wè pa deyò. Epi yo toujou la jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Pa t gen anyen nan lach la sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:2-5">Det 10:2-5</ref></char></note>de tablo ke Moïse te mete ladann nan Horeb yo, kote SENYÈ a te fè yon akò avèk fis Israël yo lè yo te sòti an Égypte la.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Lè prèt yo te vin sòti nan kote pi sen pase tout lòt kote yo, (paske tout prèt ki te prezan yo te deja sanktifye yo menm san kontwole <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:1-5">I Kwo 24:1-5</ref></char></note>divizyon sèvis pa yo), <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />epi tout chantè Levit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-4">I Kwo 25:1-4</ref></char></note>Asaph, Héman, Jeduthun, fis pa yo avèk fanmi pa yo, te abiye an twal len fen, avèk senbal, ap, gita, yo te kanpe nan kote lès a otèl la e avèk yo, san-ven prèt ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:6">II Kwo 7:6</ref></char></note>soufle twonpèt yo, <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />ansanm lè mesye twonpèt yo avèk chantè yo te gen pou fè son yo tande ansanm tankou yon sèl vwa pou lwanj avèk glwa SENYÈ a, lè yo te leve vwa yo akonpanye pa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:42">I Kwo 16:42</ref></char></note>twonpèt avèk senbal ak enstriman mizik yo, lè yo te louwe SENYÈ a e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“Paske Li bon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">lanmou dous Li a dire pou tout tan!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 5:13">Konsa, lakay SENYÈ a te ranpli avèk yon nwaj, <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />jiskaske prèt yo pa t kab kanpe pou fè sèvis akoz nwaj la. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:35">Egz 40:35</ref></char></note>glwa SENYÈ a te ranpli kay Bondye a.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:12-50">I Wa 8:12-50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi Salomon te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:1">“SENYÈ a te di ke Li ta</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:1">abite nan nwaj fonse a.<verse eid="2CH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Mwen te bati yon kay byen wo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:2">ak yon plas pou abitasyon pa W</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:2">Jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Konsa, wa a te vire fas li pou te beni tout asanble Israël la pandan tout asanble a te kanpe.<verse eid="2CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Li te di: “Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, ki te pale avèk bouch Li a papa m, David, e ki te acheve sa avèk men Li, lè li te di: <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Depi jou ke M te mennen pèp Mwen an sòti nan peyi Égypte la, Mwen pa t chwazi yon vil nan tout tribi Israël yo pou bati yon kay pou non Mwen ta kapab la, ni Mwen pa t chwazi yon moun kòm chèf sou pèp Mwen an, Israël; <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:13">II Kwo 12:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te chwazi Jérusalem pou non Mwen ta kapab la, e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:4">I Kwo 28:4</ref></char></note>te chwazi David pou li kapab sou pèp Mwen an, Israël.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:3">I Wa 5:3</ref></char></note>Alò, li te nan kè a papa m, David, pou bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Men SENYÈ a te di a papa m, David: ‘Akoz li te nan kè ou pou bati kay pou non Mwen an, ou te fè byen lè sa te nan kè ou a. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Sepandan, ou p ap bati kay la, men fis ou ki va fèt a ou menm, li va bati kay la pou non Mwen.’”<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“Koulye a, SENYÈ a gen tan fin akonpli pawòl ke Li te pale a. Paske mwen te monte nan plas a papa m David, pou chita sou twòn Israël la, jan SENYÈ a te pale a, e te bati kay la pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />La, mwen te mete lach <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:7-10">II Kwo 5:7-10</ref></char></note>ki gen akò SENYÈ a ladann nan, akò ke Li te fè avèk fis Israël yo.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Konsa, li te kanpe devan lotèl SENYÈ a nan prezans a tout asanble Israël la, e li te lonje men li. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Alò, Salomon te fè yon etaj an bwonz, senk koude nan longè, senk koude nan lajè ak twa koude nan wotè e li te plase li nan mitan gran lakou a. Epi li te kanpe sou li, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:54">I Wa 8:54</ref></char></note>te mete li ajenou nan prezans a tout asanble Israël la, e li te lonje men li vè syèl la. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Li te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Egz 15:11</ref></char></note>nanpwen dye tankou Ou nan syèl la ni sou tè a, k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Det 7:9</ref></char></note>kenbe akò avèk lanmou dous avèk sèvitè Ou yo ki mache devan Ou avèk tout kè yo; <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9-10">I Kwo 22:9-10</ref></char></note>ki te kenbe pawòl avèk sèvitè Ou, David, papa m, nan sa ke Ou te pwomèt li a. Anverite, Ou te pale avèk bouch Ou, e Ou te akonpli li avèk men Ou, jan sa ye jodi a.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />“Pou sa, O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, kenbe avèk sèvitè Ou a, David, sa ke ou te pwomèt li a. Ou te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">I Wa 2:4</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap manke yon nonm ki pou chita sou twòn Israël la, si sèlman fis ou yo fè atansyon nan chemen yo, pou mache nan lalwa pa Mwen, jan ou te mache devan M nan.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Alò, pou sa, O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, kite pawòl Ou konfime nan sa Ou te pale a sèvitè Ou a, David.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 113:5-6">Sòm 113:5-6</ref> </char></note>èske Bondye va vrèman rete avèk lòm sou tè a? Gade byen, syèl la avèk pi wo syèl la pa kab kenbe Ou; bokou mwens, pou kay sa a ke m te konstwi a. <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Malgre sa, prete atansyon a lapriyè a sèvitè Ou a, avèk sa li mande a, O SENYÈ Bondye mwen an, pou koute lè m kriye ak lapriyè ke sèvitè Ou a fè devan Ou; <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />pou zye Ou kapab ouvri vè kay sa a lajounen kon lannwit, vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Det 12:11</ref></char></note>plas sou sila Ou te di ke Ou ta mete non Ou la, pou koute lapriyè ke sèvitè Ou a va fè vè plas sa a. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Koute a siplikasyon a sèvitè Ou yo ak pèp Ou a, Israël, lè yo priye vè plas sa a; koute depi nan abitasyon Ou an, nan syèl la; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 43:25">És 43:25</ref></char></note> e lè Ou koute, padone.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Si yon nonm peche kont vwazen li, pou li oblije sèmante e li vin fè yon sèman devan lotèl Ou nan kay sila a, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />alò, tande soti nan syèl la e aji pou jije sèvitè Ou yo, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:11">És 3:11</ref></char></note>pinisyon pou mechan an k ap fè chemen pa li vin tonbe sou pwòp tèt li, epi pou rann jistis a sila ki dwat yo e ba li selon ladwati li.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“Si pèp Ou a ta vin bat devan yon lènmi akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sòm 51:4</ref></char></note>peche ke yo konn fè kont Ou, e yo retounen kote Ou pou konfese non Ou; si yo priye devan Ou e fè siplikasyon devan Ou nan kay sa a, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />alò, koute soti nan syèl la, e padone peche a pèp Ou a, Israël. Mennen yo retounen nan peyi ke Ou te bay a yo menm avèk zansèt pa yo.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>syèl yo vin fèmen e nanpwen lapli akoz peche ke yo fè kont Ou, si yo fè lapriyè vè plas sa a e konfese non Ou, pou yo vire kite peche pa yo lè Ou aflije yo; <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />alò, tande nan syèl la e padone peche a sèvitè Ou yo ak pèp Ou a, Israël. Anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:12">Sòm 94:12</ref></char></note>enstwi yo selon bon chemen nan sila yo ta dwe mache a, epi voye lapli sou tè ke Ou te bay a pèp Ou a kòm eritaj la.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Si gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:9">II Kwo 20:9</ref></char></note>gwo grangou nan peyi a, si se gwo maladi, si gen gwo dega jaden ak bèt, oswa kanni, si gen krikèt oswa bèt volan, si lènmi yo fè syèj a yo menm nan teren vil yo, nenpòt toumant, nenpòt maladi, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />nenpòt lapriyè oswa siplikasyon ki fèt pa nenpòt moun, oswa pa tout pèp Ou a, Israël, chak moun ki konnen pwòp soufrans li ak pwòp doulè li e ki vin ouvri men li vè kay sila a, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />nan lè sa a, koute depi nan syèl la, abitasyon pa Ou a, epi padone e bay a chak moun selon pwòp chemen li, kè a sila Ou konnen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:7">I Sam 16:7</ref></char></note>(paske Ou menm sèl konnen kè a fis a lòm yo), <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />pou yo ta kapab gen lakrent Ou, pou mache nan chemen Ou yo pou tout tan ke yo rete nan peyi ke Ou te bay a zansèt nou yo.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Anplis, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:3-8">És 56:3-8</ref></char></note>etranje ki pa sòti nan pèp Ou a, Israël, lè li sòti nan yon peyi lwen, akoz gran non pa Ou, avèk men pwisan Ou ak bwa Ou ki lonje byen ouvri a, lè yo vini fè lapriyè vè kay sila a, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />alò, koute depi nan syèl la, depi abitasyon Ou a, e fè selon tout sa ke etranje sila a vin mande Ou, jis pou tout pèp sou latè yo kapab konnen non Ou e gen lakrent ou, jan pèp Israël Ou a konn fè a, pou yo kapab rekonèt ke kay sila ke m te bati a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:14">II Kwo 7:14</ref></char></note>rele pa non Ou.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Lè pèp Ou a sòti pou batay kont lènmi yo, pa nenpòt chemen ke Ou ta voye yo, e yo priye a Ou menm vè vil sila ke Ou te chwazi ak kay ke m te bati pou non Ou a, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />nan lè sa a, koute lapriyè yo soti nan syèl la avèk siplikasyon yo, e bay soutyen a koz pa yo.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Lè yo fè peche kont Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 15:14-16">Job 15:14-16</ref></char></note>(paske nanpwen lòm ki pa peche), epi Ou fache avèk yo jis Ou livre yo a yon lènmi, e yo pran yo mete an kaptivite nan yon peyi lwen, oswa pre; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />si yo vin reflechi nan peyi kote yo te mennen an kaptivite a, repanti, e fè siplikasyon a Ou menm nan peyi kaptivite yo a, e di: ‘Nou te peche, nou fè inikite e te aji avèk mechanste;’ <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:12-13">Jr 29:12-13</ref></char></note>si yo retounen a Ou menm avèk tout kè yo, avèk tout nanm yo soti nan peyi kaptivite yo a, kote yo te mennen yo an kaptivite a, e priye vè peyi yo a ke Ou te bay a zansèt yo, ak vil ke Ou te chwazi a, e vè kay ke m te bati pou non Ou a, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />alò, tande, depi nan syèl la, depi nan abitasyon pa Ou a, lapriyè pa yo, avèk siplikasyon pa yo, e bay soutyen a koz pa yo, epi padone pèp Ou a ki te peche kont Ou.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Koulye a, O Bondye mwen, mwen priye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:6-11">Né 1:6-11</ref></char></note>kite zye Ou louvri e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 17:1">Sòm 17:1</ref></char></note>zòrèy ou vin atantif a lapriyè sa a, ki fèt nan plas sa a.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:8-9">Sòm 132:8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Alò, pou sa, leve, O SENYÈ Bondye, a plas repo pa Ou a, Ou menm avèk lach pwisan pa Ou a. Kite prèt Ou yo, SENYÈ Bondye, abiye avèk sali, e kite fidèl Ou yo rejwi nan tout sa ki bon.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />“O SENYÈ Bondye, pa vire kite fas a onksyone pa Ou a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:10-12">Sòm 132:10-12</ref></char></note>Sonje lanmou dous Ou vè sèvitè Ou a, David.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:54">I Wa 8:54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lè Salomon te fin fè priyè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:23">Lev 9:23</ref></char></note>dife a te sòti nan syèl la pou te boule ofrann brile a avèk sakrifis yo; e glwa a SENYÈ a te ranpli kay la. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:14">II Kwo 5:14</ref></char></note>Prèt yo pa t kab antre lakay SENYÈ a akoz glwa SENYÈ a te ranpli kay la. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Tout fis Israël yo, lè yo te wè dife a desann, e glwa SENYÈ a sou kay la, yo te bese ba sou pave a avèk figi yo atè pou yo te adore e te bay lwanj a SENYÈ a. Yo te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 5:13">II Kwo 5:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Konsa Li bon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">paske lanmou dous Li a dire pou tout tan,”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:62-63">I Wa 8:62-63</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi wa a avèk tout pèp la te ofri sakrifis devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Wa Salomon te ofri yon sakrifis a venn-de-mil bèf ak san-ven-mil mouton. Konsa, wa a avèk tout pèp la te dedye kay Bondye a. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Prèt yo te kanpe nan pòs pa yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16-21">I Kwo 15:16-21</ref></char></note>Levit yo tou avèk enstriman mizik a SENYÈ a, ke Wa David te fè pou bay lwanj a SENYÈ a lè David te bay lwanj sèvis yo. E yo te di, “Paske lanmou dous Li a dire pou tout tan”. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:12">II Kwo 5:12</ref></char></note>Konsa, prèt yo te soufle twonpèt devan yo, epi tout Israël te kanpe.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:64-66">I Wa 8:64-66</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salomon te konsakre mitan lakou ki te devan kay SENYÈ a pou fè l sen. Paske la, li te ofri ofrann brile ak grès ofrann lapè yo akoz lotèl an bwonz ke Salomon te fè a pa t kab kenbe ofrann brile a, ofrann sereyal la ak grès la.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:65">I Wa 8:65</ref></char></note>Salomon te obsève fèt la nan tan sa a pandan sèt jou e tout Israël avèk li; yon trè gran asanble ki te sòti depi nan antre Hamath jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>flèv Égypte la.<verse eid="2CH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Nan uityèm jou a, yo te kenbe yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref></char></note>asanble solanèl pou obsève dedikasyon lotèl la. Yo te obsève l pou sèt jou, e fèt la pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Epi sou venn-twazyèm jou nan setyèm mwa a, li te voye pèp la nan tant yo, ranpli avèk jwa e avèk kè kontan, akoz bonte ke SENYÈ a te montre a David, a Salomon e a pèp Li a, Israël.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se konsa Salomon te fini kay SENYÈ a avèk palè wa a, e li te acheve nèt tout sa ke li te fè plan pou fè lakay SENYÈ a ak nan kay pa li a.<verse eid="2CH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te parèt a Salomon nan nwit lan. Li te di l: “Mwen te tande lapriyè ou a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5-11">Det 12:5-11</ref></char></note>Mwen te chwazi plas sa a pou Mwen menm kòm yon kay sakrifis.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 6:26-28">II Kwo 6:26-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Si Mwen vin fèmen syèl yo pou pa gen lapli, oswa si Mwen kòmande krikèt yo pou devore latè, oswa si Mwen voye toumant pami pèp Mwen an, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:37-39">II Kwo 6:37-39</ref></char></note>epi pèp Mwen ki rele pa non Mwen an vin imilye yo, priye, chache fas Mwen e vire kite abitid mechan yo; nan moman sa a, Mwen va tande yo soti nan syèl la. Mwen va padone peche pa yo, e Mwen va geri peyi yo. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:20-40">II Kwo 6:20-40</ref></char></note>Koulye a, zye M va louvri e zòrèy Mwen va vin atantif a lapriyè ki ofri nan plas sa a. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:12">II Kwo 7:12</ref></char></note>koulye a, Mwen gen tan chwazi e konsakre kay sila a pou non Mwen kapab la jis pou tout tan. Zye Mwen ak kè Mwen va la pou tout tan.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />“Epi pou ou menm, si ou mache devan M tankou papa ou, David te mache a, fè selon tout sa ke Mwen te kòmande ou yo, e kenbe règleman Mwen yo avèk òdonans Mwen yo, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />alò, Mwen va etabli twòn wayal ou a jan Mwen te sèmante a David la, lè M te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">I Wa 2:4</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap manke yon nonm ki pou gouvène an Israël.’<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:14-33">Lev 26:14-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Men si ou vire kite e abandone règleman Mwen yo, avèk kòmandman ke M te mete devan ou yo, pou ale sèvi lòt dye yo e adore yo, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />alò, Mwen va dechouke ou soti nan peyi ke M te ba ou a, ak kay sa a, ke Mwen te konsakre pou non pa Mwen an, Mwen va jete l andeyò vizaj Mwen, e Mwen va fè li yon pwovèb ak yon rizib pami tout pèp yo. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Epi pou kay sila a, ki egzalte tèlman wo, tout moun ki pase kote li va etone e va di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24-27">Det 29:24-27</ref></char></note>“Poukisa SENYÈ a te fè sa a peyi sila a, e a kay sila a? <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Epi konsa, yo va reponn: ‘Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:13">Jij 2:13</ref> </char></note>yo te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a, ki te mennen yo soti nan peyi Égypte la, pou yo te adopte lòt dye yo, e te adore yo e te sèvi yo. Se pou sa, Li te mennen tout mal sila a sou yo.’”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">I Wa 9:10-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive nan fen ven ane pandan sila yo Salomon te bati kay SENYÈ a avèk pwòp kay li a, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />ke li te fin bati vil ke Huram te ba li yo, e li te etabli Izrayelit yo ladann.<verse eid="2CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Epi Salomon te ale kote Hamath-Tsoba e te kaptire li. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Li te bati Thadmor nan dezè a ak tout vil depo ke li te bati nan Hamath yo. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Anplis, li te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:24">I Kwo 7:24</ref></char></note>Wo Beth-Horon an avèk Ba Beth-Horon an, vil fòtifye avèk miray, pòtay ak fè fòje; <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />avèk Baalath ak tout vil depo ke Salomon te genyen yo, tout vil pou cha li yo avèk vil pou chevalye yo ak tout sa ki te fè kè Salomon kontan pou bati nan Jérusalem, nan Liban ak nan tout peyi ki te anba règleman li yo.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Jen 15:18-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout moun nan pèp la ki te rete nan Etyen yo, Amoreyen yo, Ferezyen yo, Evyen yo, avèk Jebizyen ki pa t yon pati nan Israël, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />ki te sòti nan desandan pa yo ki te kite nan peyi, ke fis Israël yo pa t detwi yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">I Wa 4:6</ref></char></note>yo menm, Salomon te fè yo leve kòm ouvriye kòve ki fèt jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Men Salomon pa t fè esklav pou travay li pami fis Israël yo. Yo te mesye lagè, chèf kapitèn li avèk kòmandan a cha li yo ak chevalye li yo. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Sila yo te chèf prensipal a Wa Salomon; de san senkant yo ki te dirijan sou pèp la.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Salomon te mennen fè monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">I Wa 3:1</ref></char></note>fi a Farawon an soti Jérusalem pou rive nan kay ke li te bati pou li a, paske li te di: “Madanm mwen p ap rete lakay David, wa Israël la, akoz plas yo kote lach SENYÈ a te ye a sen.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Salomon te ofri ofrann brile bay SENYÈ a, sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:1">II Kwo 4:1</ref></char></note>lotèl ke li te bati devan galri a. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Sa te fèt selon règleman a chak jou. Li te ofri yo selon lòd Moïse pou Saba yo, nouvèl lin yo, fèt apwente yo twa fwa pa lan yo—Fèt Pen San Ledven an, Fèt Semèn Yo, ak Fèt Tonèl Yo.<verse eid="2CH 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Alò, selon règleman a papa li yo, David, li te chwazi divizyon a prèt yo pou sèvis pa yo, Levit yo pou devwa pa yo, pou fè lwanj e fè sèvis devan prèt yo selon règ a chak jou a, e gadyen pòtay pa divizyon pa yo nan chak pòtay. Paske se konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:24-36">Né 12:24-36</ref></char></note>David, nonm Bondye a, te konn kòmande sa. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Epi yo pa t varye menm nan lòd wa a ak prèt yo avèk Levit yo nan okenn fason ki te konsène kay depo trezò yo.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Konsa, tout travay a Salomon an te akonpli depi jou lakay SENYÈ a te etabli a, jiskaske li te fini. Konsa, lakay SENYÈ a te konplete.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Konsa, Salomon te ale kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:26">I Wa 9:26</ref></char></note>Etsjon-Guéber ak Élath sou lanmè peyi Édom an. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Epi Huram, pa sèvitè li yo te voye bato kote li avèk sèvitè ki te konnen lanmè yo. Yo te ale avèk sèvitè a Salomon yo nan Ophir e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:10-13">II Kwo 9:10-13</ref></char></note>pran soti la, kat-san-senkant talan lò pou te pote yo kote Wa Salomon an.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">I Wa 10:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, depi rèn Séba te tande afè rekonesans a Salomon an, li te vini Jérusalem pou fè pase Salomon a leprèv avèk kesyon ki te byen difisil. Li te gen yon gran konpanyen moun avèk chamo chaje avèk epis ak yon gran kantite lò, avèk pyè presye. Lè li te rive kote Salomon, li te pale avèk li selon tout sa ki te nan kè li. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Salomon te reponn tout kesyon li yo. Anyen pa t kache a Salomon ke li pa t eksplike li. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Lè rèn Séba te fin wè sajès a Salomon an, kay ke li te bati a, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />manje sou tab li, aranjman pozisyon chèz sèvitè li yo, konpòtman avèk abiman ministè li yo, eskalye li a sou sila li te konn monte pou rive lakay SENYÈ a, sa te fè l pèdi souf.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Li te di a wa a: “Se te verite; rapò ke m te tande nan pwòp peyi mwen konsènan pawòl avèk sajès ou. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Sepandan, mwen pa t kwè rapò yo jiskaske m te rive, e zye m vin wè. Epi vwala, mwatye a grandè a sajès yo pa t pale mwen sa. Ou depase rapò ke m te tande a. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Jan mesye pa ou yo beni, jan sèvitè ou yo ki kanpe devan ou tout tan pou tande sajès ou yo beni! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Beniswa SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, ki te pran plezi nan ou, e ki te mete ou sou twòn Li kòm wa pou SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:8">Det 7:8</ref></char></note>akoz Bondye ou a te renmen Israël, Li etabli yo jis pou tout tan. Pou sa, Li te fè ou wa sou yo, pou fè lajistis avèk ladwati.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Apre sa, li te bay wa a san-ven talan lò avèk yon trè gran kantite epis avèk pyè presye. Pa t janm te kon gen epis kon sa yo ke rèn Séba te bay a Wa Salomon an.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Sèvitè a Huram yo avèk sèvitè a Salomon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:11">I Wa 10:11</ref></char></note>ki te pote lò sòti nan Ophir yo, anplis te pote bwa sandal avèk pyè presye yo. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Avèk bwa sandal yo, wa a te fè eskalye pou kay SENYÈ a ak pou palè wa a ak gita, avèk ap pou chantè yo. Epi nanpwen bagay konsa ki te konn wè avan nan peyi Juda. <verse eid="2CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Wa Salomon te bay a rèn Séba tout dezi li nan sa li te mande, plis ke sa li te pote bay wa a. Alò, li te vire retounen nan peyi li avèk sèvitè li yo.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:14-28">I Wa 10:14-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, pwa a lò ki te vini a Salomon nan en an te sis-san-swasann-sis talan an lò, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />anplis de sa ke machann avèk komèsan yo te pote. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:29">Sòm 68:29</ref></char></note>Tout wa Arabie avèk dirijan peyi sa yo te mennen lò avèk ajan bay Salomon. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Wa Salomon te fè de-san gran boukliye defans an lò bat, ki te sèvi sis-san sik lò nan chak gran boukliye. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Li te fè twa-san boukliye ki te sèvi twa-san sik lò sou chak boukliye e wa a te mete yo nan kay Forè Liban an. <verse eid="2CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Anplis, wa a te fè yon gran twòn avèk ivwa, e li te kouvri li avèk lò pi. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Te gen sis mach pye eskalye ki pou rive nan twòn nan ak yon mach pye eskalye an lò ki te tache a twòn nan, avèk manch nan chak kote chèz la, avèk de lyon ki te kanpe akote manch yo. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Douz lyon yo te kanpe la sou sis etap eskalye sou yon kote ak sou lòt la. Nanpwen anyen tankou li ki te fèt pou okenn lòt wayòm. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Tout veso pou bwè ke Salomon te genyen yo te fèt an lò, e tout veso nan kay Forè Liban an te lò pi. Ajan pa t konsidere kòm tèlman valab nan jou a Salomon yo. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:36">II Kwo 20:36</ref></char></note>Paske wa a te gen bato ki te konn ale Tarsis avèk sèvitè a Huram yo. Yon fwa chak twazan, bato Tarsis yo te antre avèk lò ak ajan, ivwa, makak ak zwazo pan yo.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:13">I Wa 3:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Wa Salomon te vin pi gran pase tout wa sou latè yo nan richès avèk sajès. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Epi tout wa latè yo t ap chache prezans a Salomon pou tande sajès ke Bondye te mete nan kè li. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:10">Sòm 72:10</ref></char></note>Yo chak te pote pwòp kado pa yo: bagay an ajan avèk lò, vètman, zam, epis, cheval, milèt, an gran kantite ane pa ane. <verse eid="2CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Alò, Salomon te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Det 17:16</ref></char></note>kat-mil estasyon separe pou cheval avèk cha e douz-mil chevalye. Li te pozisyone yo nan vil cha yo ak kote wa a nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>Li te mèt sou tout wa yo soti nan Rivyè Euphrate la, jis rive nan peyi Filisten yo, e jis rive nan lizyè Égypte la. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:15-17">II Kwo 1:15-17</ref></char></note>Wa a te fè ajan gaye tankou wòch Jérusalem, e li te fè sèd yo anpil tankou bwa sikomò ki nan ba plèn nan. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:16">II Kwo 1:16</ref></char></note>Yo te mennen cheval pou Salomon soti an Égypte avèk tout peyi yo.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">I Wa 11:41-43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Salomon yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:29">I Kwo 29:29</ref></char></note>èske yo pa ekri nan rekò a Nathan yo, pwofèt la, nan pwofesi Achija a, Silonit lan, ak nan vizyon a Jéedo yo, konseye a Jéroboam nan, fis a Nebath la? <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:42-43">I Wa 11:42-43</ref></char></note>Salomon te renye pandan karantan Jérusalem ak sou tout Israël. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Salomon te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere nan lavil papa li, David. Fis li, Roboam te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">I Wa 12:1-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Roboam te ale Sichem, paske tout Israël te vini Sichem pou fè l vin wa. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Lè Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la te tande sa, (paske li te an Égypte kote li te sove ale rive pou l kite prezans a wa Salomon), Jéroboam te retounen soti an Égypte. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Pou sa, yo te voye lòd pou l vini. Lè Jéroboam avèk tout Israël te vini, yo te pale ak Roboam. Yo te di: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Papa ou te fè fado <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:13-16">I Wa 5:13-16</ref></char></note>nou rèd. Alò, pou sa, lache sèvis di a papa ou ak fado lou a ke li te konn mete sou nou an, e nou va sèvi ou.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Li te di yo: “Retounen kote mwen nan twa jou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 10:5">Konsa, pèp la te ale.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Alò, Wa Roboam te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:8-9">Job 8:8-9</ref></char></note>konsiltasyon avèk ansyen ki te konn sèvi papa li yo, Salomon pandan li te vivan an. Li te mande yo: “Ki konsèy n ap ban mwen pou reponn a pèp sila a?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Yo te pale avèk li e te di: “Si ou va aji nan dousè avèk pèp sa a, si ou va fè yo kontan e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:1">Pwov 15:1</ref></char></note>pale pawòl dous ak yo, alò, yo va vin sèvi ou nèt.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Men li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:4">II Sam 17:4</ref></char></note>echwe konsèy ansyen yo te bay li yo, pou l te konsilte jennonm ki te grandi ansanm avè l e ki te kanpe devan l. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Konsa, li te mande yo: “Ki konsèy n ap ban mwen pou m ta reponn pèp sila a, ki te pale avèk mwen, ki te di: ‘Fè fado ke papa ou te konn mete sou nou an vin pi lejè?’”<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Jennonm ki te konn grandi avèk li yo te pale avèk li. Yo te di: “Konsa ou va reponn a pèp sila ki te pale avèk ou a, ki te di: ‘Papa ou te fè jouk nou lou; men ou menm, fè l pi lejè pou nou.’ Konsa, ou va reponn yo: ‘Ti dwèt mwen pi gwo pase ren papa m! <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Konsi papa m te chaje nou avèk yon jouk lou, mwen va mete anplis sou jouk nou an. Papa m te konn disipline avèk fwèt, men mwen menm, avèk eskòpyon.’”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Konsa, Jéroboam avèk tout pèp la te parèt a Roboam nan twazyèm jou a jan wa a te mande lè l te di: “Retounen kote mwen nan twazyèm jou a.” <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Wa a te reponn yo byen di, e Wa Roboam te echwe konsèy a ansyen yo. <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />Li te pale avèk yo selon konsèy a jennonm yo, e li te di: “Papa m te konn fè jouk nou lou, men mwen va mete anplis sou li. Papa m te fè disiplin avèk fwèt, men mwen va fè disiplin avèk eskòpyon.”<verse eid="2CH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Konsa, wa a pa t koute pèp la, paske sa se te yon boulvèsman ki te soti nan Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:29-39">I Wa 11:29-39</ref></char></note>pou SENYÈ a ta kapab etabli pawòl ke Li te pale pa Achija, Silonit lan, a Jéroboam nan, fis a Nebath la.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Lè tout Israël te wè ke wa a pa t koute yo, pèp la te reponn wa a e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">II Sam 20:1</ref></char></note>“Ki pòsyon nou gen nan David? Nanpwen eritaj pou nou nan fis Jesse a! Tout gason rive nan tant ou, O Israël! Koulye a, David, okipe pwòp lakay ou!” Konsa, tout Israël te pati rive nan tant yo.<verse eid="2CH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Men pou fis Israël ki te rive nan vil a Juda yo, Roboam te renye sou yo. <verse eid="2CH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Epi Wa Roboam te voye Hadoram ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">I Wa 4:6</ref></char></note>chèf kòve yo, e fis Israël yo te lapide li ak kout wòch jiskaske li te mouri. Wa Roboam te fè vit monte cha li pou sove ale rive Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:19">I Wa 12:19</ref></char></note>Israël te vin nan rebelyon kont kay David la jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">I Wa 12:21-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lè Roboam te vini Jérusalem. Li te rasanble lakay Juda avèk Benjamin, san-katre-ven-mil mesye byen chwazi ki te gèrye, pou goumen kont Israël pou reprann wayòm nan pou Roboam. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Men pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:5-7">II Kwo 12:5-7-15</ref></char></note>Schemaeja, nonm Bondye a, Li te di: <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Pale a Roboam, fis a Salomon an, wa a Juda a ak tout Israël nan Juda avèk Benjamin pou di: <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: “Nou pa pou monte ni goumen kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:8-11">II Kwo 28:8-11</ref></char></note>fanmi pa nou yo! Retounen chak mesye yo lakay yo, paske bagay sa a sòti nan Mwen menm.”’” Konsa, yo te koute pawòl SENYÈ a, e yo te retounen pou yo pa sòti kont Jéroboam.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Roboam te viv Jérusalem, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:2-6">II Kwo 8:2-6</ref></char></note>bati vil pou fè defans nan Juda. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Konsa li te bati Bethléem, Étham, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beth-Tsur, Soko, Adullam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gath, Maréscha, Ziph, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraïm, Lakis, Azéka <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Tsorea, Ajalon avèk Hébron, ki se vil fòtifye nan Juda ak nan Benjamin. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Anplis, li te ranfòse fò yo, e li te mete kòmandan ladan yo avèk depo manje, lwil ak diven. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Li te mete boukliye defans avèk lans nan chak vil yo, e li te byen fòtifye yo. Konsa, Juda avèk Benjamin te pou li.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Anplis, prèt avèk Levit ki te nan tout Israël yo te kanpe avèk li soti nan landwa pa yo. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:2-5">Nonb 35:2-5</ref></char></note>Levit yo te kite tè patiraj pa yo pou te rive Juda avèk Jérusalem, paske Jéroboam te bloke sèvis yo kòm prèt SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31">I Wa 12:31</ref></char></note>Li te etabli prèt pa li yo pou kont li pou sèvi nan wo plas yo, pou imaj bouk yo avèk jenn bèf ke li te fè yo. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:9">II Kwo 15:9</ref></char></note>Sila yo nan tout tribi Israël ki te dispoze kè yo pou swiv SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te swiv yo rive Jérusalem pou fè sakrifis a SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Yo te fòtifye wayòm Juda a, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:1">II Kwo 12:1</ref></char></note>bay soutyen a Roboam, fis Salomon nan pandan twazan, paske yo te mache nan chemen David avèk Salomon an pandan twazan.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Alò, Roboam te pran kòm madanm li, Mahalath, fi a Jerimoth la, fis a David la avèk Abichaïl, fi a Éliab la, fis a Jesse a. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Li te fè fis yo: Jeusch, Schemaria, avèk Zaham. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Apre, li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:2">I Wa 15:2</ref></char></note>Maaca, fi a Absalom an. Li te fè pou li Abija, Attaï, Ziza, avèk Schelomith. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Roboam te renmen Maaca, fi a Absalom an plis pase tout lòt madanm avèk ti mennaj li yo. Paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Det 17:17</ref></char></note>pran dizuit madanm avèk swasant mennaj, e li te fè venn-tuit fis ak swasant fi. <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Roboam te chwazi Abija, fis a Maaca a kòm chèf e dirijan pami frè li yo, paske li te gen entansyon fè l wa. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Li te aji avèk sajès, e li te plase fis li yo nan tout teritwa a Juda avèk Benjamin nan tout vil fòtifye yo, e li te ba yo anpil manje. Epi li te chache anpil madanm pou yo.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Lè wayòm a Roboam nan te fin etabli e li te gen fòs, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:13-16">II Kwo 26:13-16</ref></char></note>li menm ak tout Israël avèk li te abandone lalwa SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:25">I Wa 14:25</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te vin rive nan senkyèm ane a Roboam nan, akoz yo pa t fidèl a SENYÈ a, ke Schischak, wa Égypte la, te monte kont Jérusalem, <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />avèk mil-de-san cha ak swasann-di-mil chevalye. Epi moun ki te vini avèk li soti an Égypte yo te depase kontwòl: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:8">II Kwo 16:8</ref></char></note>Libyen yo, Sikyen ak Etyopyen yo. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Li te kaptire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:5-12">II Kwo 11:5-12</ref></char></note>vil fòtifye Juda yo, e li te rive jis Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:2">II Kwo 11:2</ref> </char></note>Schemaeja, pwofèt la, te vin kote Roboam avèk chèf Juda ki te rasanble nan Jérusalem akoz Schischak yo, e li te di yo: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Ou te abandone Mwen, e pou sa, Mwen te abandone ou bay Schischak.’”<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Pou sa, chèf Israël yo avèk wa a te imilye yo. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:27">Egz 9:27</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a jis.”<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Lè SENYÈ a te wè ke yo te imilye yo, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Schemaeja, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:29">I Wa 21:29</ref></char></note>“Yo te imilye yo. Pou sa, Mwen p ap detwi yo, men Mwen va ba yo yon mezi delivrans, e lakòlè Mwen p ap vide sou Jérusalem pa mwayen a Schischak. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Men yo va devni esklav li, pou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:47-48">Det 28:47-48</ref> </char></note>kab vin konprann antre sèvi Mwen ak sèvi wayòm lòt peyi yo.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Konsa Schischak, wa Égypte la, te monte kont Jérusalem, e li te pran tout trezò lakay SENYÈ a ak trezò nan palè wa a. Li te pran tout bagay. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Konsa, Wa Roboam te fè boukliye defans an bwonz pou ranplase yo, e li te mete yo anba pwotèj a kòmandan gad ki te gadyen pòtay lakay wa yo. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Depi wa a te antre lakay SENYÈ a, gad yo te pote yo vini, e apre, yo te mennen yo tounen nan chanm gad yo. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Epi lè li te fin imilye li, lakòlè SENYÈ a te vire kite li, pou l pa ta detwi nèt; epi anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">II Kwo 19:3</ref></char></note>tout bagay te mache byen an Juda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:21">I Wa 14:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Wa Roboam te ranfòse tèt li Jérusalem, e li te renye. Alò, Roboam te gen laj karanteyen ane lè li te kòmanse renye, e li te renye di-sèt-ane Jérusalem, vil ke SENYÈ a te chwazi soti nan tout tribi Israël yo pou mete non Li an. Epi non manman li te Naama, Amoreyèn nan. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Li te fè mal, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">II Kwo 19:3</ref></char></note>paske li pa t aplike kè l pou konnen SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:29">I Wa 14:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, zèv a Roboam yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, èske yo pa ekri nan rekò a Schemaeja yo, pwofèt a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:29">II Kwo 9:29</ref></char></note>Iddo a, konseye a, selon anrejistreman zansèt yo? Epi te gen lagè kont Roboam avèk Jéroboam tout tan. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Konsa, Roboam te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere nan lavil David la. Epi fis li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:20">II Kwo 11:20</ref></char></note>Abija te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:1-2">I Wa 15:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan di-zuityèm ane Wa Jéroboam nan, Abijah te devni wa sou Juda. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />Li te renye pandan twazan Jérusalem. Non manman l te Micaja, fi a Uriel la nan Guibea. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:7">I Wa 15:7</ref></char></note>Alò, te gen lagè antre Abija avèk Jéroboam. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abija te ouvri batay la avèk yon lame gèrye vanyan, kat-san-mil mesye byen chwazi, pandan Jéroboam t ap fè fòmasyon batay la kont li avèk ui-san-mil mesye byen chwazi, gèrye vanyan. <verse eid="2CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abija te kanpe sou Mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:22">Jos 18:22</ref></char></note>Tsemaraïm ki nan peyi ti mòn Éphraïm yo, e li te di: “Koute mwen, O Jéroboam avèk tout Israël: <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Èske ou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">II Sam 7:12-16</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, te bay pouvwa sou Israël jis pou tout tan a David avèk fis li yo pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:13">Lev 2:13</ref></char></note>yon sèl akò? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:26">I Wa 11:26</ref></char></note>Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la, sèvitè a Salomon an, fis a David la, te leve e te fè rebèl kont mèt li a. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Yon bann sanzave te rasanble vè li menm, vagabon yo, yon eprèv ki te twò fò pou Roboam, fis a Salomon an, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:13">II Kwo 12:13</ref></char></note>li te trè jèn, timid e li pa t ka kenbe plas pa l kont yo.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“Epi koulye a, ou gen entansyon fè rezistans kont wayòm SENYÈ a pa fis a David yo. Se yon gran foul nou ye, e nou gen avèk nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref></char></note>jenn bèf an lò ke Jéroboam te fè kòm dye pou nou. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:14-15">II Kwo 11:14-15</ref></char></note>Èske nou pa t chase mete deyò prèt SENYÈ yo, fis a Aaron yo avèk Levit yo, e te fè pou kont nou prèt tankou pèp lòt peyi yo? Nenpòt moun ki vini konsakre li menm avèk yon jenn towo ak sèt belye, menm li menm kapab devni yon prèt a sila ki pa dye yo.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Men pou nou, SENYÈ a se Bondye pa nou an e nou pa t abandone Li. Fis Aaron yo ap fè sèvis a SENYÈ a kòm prèt e se Levit yo ki fè travay a yo menm. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Chak maten e chak swa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Egz 29:38</ref></char></note>yo brile bay SENYÈ a ofrann brile avèk lansan santi bon, pen konsakre ki sou tab pwòp, e chandelye a avèk lanp li yo pou limen chak swa; paske nou kenbe chaj a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, men ou te abandone Li. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Koulye a, veye byen, Bondye avèk nou sou tèt nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:8-9">Nonb 10:8-9</ref></char></note>prèt Li yo avèk twonpèt siyal pou sonnen alam kont nou. O fis Israël yo, pa goumen kont SENYÈ a zansèt nou yo, paske nou p ap reyisi.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Men Jéroboam <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:4-9">Jos 8:4-9</ref></char></note>te fè yon anbiskad pou vini pa dèyè, pou Israël ta devan Juda e anbiskad la pa dèyè yo. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Lè Juda te vire, alò yo te atake ni devan ni dèyè; pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">II Kwo 14:11</ref></char></note>yo te kriye a SENYÈ a e prèt yo te soufle twonpèt yo. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Konsa mesye Juda te fè leve kri lagè a, e nan moman sa a, Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:12">II Kwo 14:12</ref></char></note>boulvèse Jéroboam avèk tout Israël devan Abija avèk Juda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Lè fis Israël yo te fin sove ale devan Juda, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:8">II Kwo 16:8</ref></char></note>Bondye te livre yo nan men yo. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abija avèk pèp li a te detwi yo avèk yon gwo masak, jiskaske senk-san-mil mesye Israël te tonbe mouri. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Konsa, fis Israël yo te soumèt nan tan sa a, e fis Juda yo te pran viktwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">II Kwo 14:11</ref></char></note>akoz yo te depan de SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a. <verse eid="2CH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abija te kouri dèyè Jéroboam e te kaptire plizyè vil nan men li: Béthel avèk bouk pa li yo, Jeschana avèk bouk pa li yo, e Éphron avèk bouk pa li yo.<verse eid="2CH 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Jéroboam pa t ankò reprann fòs li nan jou a Abija yo. SENYÈ a te frape li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:20">I Wa 14:20</ref></char></note>li te vin mouri. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Men Abija te vin fò. Li te pran katòz madanm pou kont li, e li te devni papa a venn-de fis ak sèz fi. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Alò, tout lòt zèv Abija yo, avèk chemen pa li yo ekri nan memwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:29">II Kwo 9:29</ref></char></note> pwofèt la, Iddo.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:8">I Wa 15:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Abija te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li nan lavil David la. Fis li a, Asa, te vin wa nan plas li. Peyi a te rete kalm e san pwoblèm pandan dizan pandan jou li yo. <verse eid="2CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa te fè byen ak sa ki dwat nan zye SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />paske li te retire lotèl etranje yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:12-14">I Wa 15:12-14</ref></char></note>wo plas yo, e li te chire pilye sakre yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:13">Egz 34:13</ref></char></note>Asherim yo. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Li te kòmande Juda pou chache SENYÈ a zansèt yo a, e swiv lalwa avèk kòmandman an. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Li te osi retire wo plas yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:4-7">II Kwo 34:4-7</ref></char></note>lotèl lansan yo soti nan tout vil Juda yo. Wayòm nan te rete kalm anba li. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Li te bati vil fòtifye Juda yo, akoz peyi a te san pwoblèm e pa t gen okenn moun ki te fè lagè avèk li pandan ane sila yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:15">II Kwo 15:15</ref></char></note>akoz SENYÈ a te ba li repo. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Paske li te di a Juda: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:5">II Kwo 8:5</ref></char></note>“Annou bati vil sila yo e antoure yo avèk miray avèk wo tou, pòtay avèk ba an fè. Peyi a toujou pou nou akoz nou te chache SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. Nou te chache Li, e Li te bannou repo sou tout kote.” Konsa yo te bati e yo te byen reyisi.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Alò, Asa te gen yon lame a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:3">II Kwo 13:3</ref></char></note>twa-san-mil mesye soti nan Juda, avèk gran boukliye defans ak lans e de-san-katreven-mil soti nan Benjamin ki te pote boukliye defans e te manyen banza. Tout nan yo, te gèrye ki plen kouraj.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Alò, Zérach, Etyopyen an, te vin parèt kont yo avèk yon lame a yon-milyon moun ak twa-san cha, e li te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:8">II Kwo 11:8</ref></char></note>Maréscha. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Pou sa, Asa te sòti pou rankontre li, e yo te parèt nan chan batay yo nan vale Maréschja a. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Konsa, Asa te rele SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. Li te di: “SENYÈ, nanpwen lòt sof ke Ou menm pou ede pami pwisan yo, ak sila ki san fòs. Pou sa, ede nou, O SENYÈ, Bondye nou an; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:18">II Kwo 13:18</ref></char></note>paske nou mete konfyans nan Ou, e nan non Ou, nou te vini kont gran foul sila a. O SENYÈ, se Ou ki Bondye nou an. Pa kite lòm pran viktwa kont Ou menm.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:15">II Kwo 13:15</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te boulvèse Etyopyen devan Asa yo ak devan Juda yo, e Etyopyen yo te sove ale. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa avèk moun ki te avèk li yo te kouri dèyè yo jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:19">Jen 10:19</ref></char></note>Guérar. Yon tèlman gran kantite Etyopyen te tonbe ke yo pa t kab kanpe ankò; paske yo te kraze nèt devan SENYÈ a ak devan lame Li a. Lame Juda a te pote fè sòti yon trè gran piyaj. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Yo te detwi tout vil ki te antoure Guérar yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:10">II Kwo 17:10</ref></char></note>paske laperèz SENYÈ a te fin tonbe sou vil yo. Epi yo te depouye tout vil yo, paske yo te gen anpil piyaj. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Anplis, yo te touye sila ki te gen bèt yo, e yo te pote ale yon gran kantite mouton avèk chamo. Answit, yo te retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:14">II Kwo 20:14</ref></char></note>Lespri Bondye a te vini sou Azaria, fis a Obed la. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Li te sòti deyò pou rankontre Asa e li te di li: “Koute mwen, Asa e tout Juda avèk Benjamin: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:17">II Kwo 20:17</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a avèk nou lè nou avèk Li. Epi si ou chache Li, Li va kite ou jwenn Li; men si ou abandone Li, Li va abandone ou. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-33">I Wa 12:28-33</ref></char></note>Pandan anpil jou, Israël te kon san vrè Bondye a, san enstriksyon, san prèt e san lalwa. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Det 4:29</ref></char></note>nan gran twoub yo, yo te vire kote SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. Yo te chache Li e yo te jwenn Li. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:6">Jij 5:6</ref></char></note>Nan tan sa yo, pa t gen lapè pou sila ki sòti, ni sila ki antre a, paske anpil gwo zen te twouble tout moun ki te rete nan peyi yo. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:7">Mat 24:7</ref></char></note>Nasyon te kraze pa nasyon, vil pa vil, paske Bondye te twouble yo avèk tout kalite gwo twoub. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Men nou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:7-9">Jos 1:7-9</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm e pa pèdi kouraj, paske gen rekonpans pou travay nou yo.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Lè Asa te tande pawòl sila yo avèk pwofesi ke Azaria, fis a Obed la, te pale a, li te pran kouraj, e li te retire zidòl abominab yo soti nan tout peyi Juda avèk Benjamin yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:19">II Kwo 13:19</ref></char></note>ak nan vil ke li te kaptire nan peyi kolin Éphraïm yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:1">II Kwo 4:1</ref></char></note>Lè l fini, li te restore lotèl SENYÈ a ki te devan galri SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Li te rasanble tout Juda avèk Benjamin avèk tout sila ki te sòti Éphraïm, Manassé ak Siméon yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:16">II Kwo 11:16</ref></char></note>ki te rete avèk yo, paske anpil nan yo te vin jwenn li soti an Israël lè yo te wè ke SENYÈ a, Bondye a, te avèk li. <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Konsa, yo te rasanble Jérusalem nan twazyèm mwa, nan kenzyèm ane, nan règn Asa a. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:13-15">II Kwo 14:13-15</ref></char></note>Yo te fè sakrifis bay SENYÈ a nan jou sa a, sèt-san bèf avèk sèt-mil mouton soti nan piyaj ke yo te pote a. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:16">II Kwo 23:16</ref></char></note>Yo te antre nan akò pou chache SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a, avèk tout kè yo ak nanm yo; <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />epi ke nenpòt moun ki te refize chache SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Egz 22:20</ref></char></note>ta dwe mete a lanmò, piti kon gran, gason kon fanm. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Anplis, yo te fè yon sèman bay SENYÈ avèk yon gwo kri, avèk twonpèt e avèk ti twonpèt wo vwa a. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Tout Juda te rejwi akoz sèman an, paske yo te sèmante avèk tout kè yo. Yo te chache Li ak kè onèt yo, e Li te kite yo jwenn Li. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:7">II Kwo 14:7</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te ba yo repo tout kote.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:13-15">I Wa 15:13-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anplis, li te retire Maaca, manman a Wa Asa a, nan pozisyon rèn nan, akoz li te fè imaj li byen abominab tankou yon Astarté, e Asa te fè koupe imaj abominab li a. Li te kraze li, e li brile li nan flèv Cédron an. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Men wo plas yo pat retire soti an Israël; sepandan, kè Asa te san repwòch pandan tout jou li yo. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Li te pote lakay SENYÈ a tout bagay dedye ki te pou papa li ak bagay dedye ki te pou li yo: ajan avèk lò avèk zouti. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Epi pa t gen lagè ankò jis rive nan trann-senk ane règn a Asa a.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Nan trann-sizyèm ane règn Asa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">I Wa 15:17-22</ref></char></note>Baasha, wa a Israël la, te vin monte kont Juda, e li te ranfòse Rama pou anpeche ni antre, ni sòti, vè Asa, wa Juda a. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Konsa, Asa te pote fè sòti ajan avèk lò soti nan trezò lakay SENYÈ a avèk lakay wa a, e li te voye yo kote Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, ki te rete Damas la. Li te di: <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Kite genyen yon alyans antre ou menm avèk mwen, tankou antre papa m ak papa ou. Gade byen, mwen te voye ba ou ajan avèk lò. Ale, kraze alyans ou an avèk Baasha, wa Israël la, pou li retire li sou mwen.”<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Konsa, Ben-Hadad te koute wa Asa. Li te voye chèf lame li yo kont vil Israël yo, e yo te frape Ijjon, Dan, Abel-Maïm, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:11">Egz 1:11</ref></char></note>tout vil depo Nephthali yo. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Lè Baasha te tande sa, li te sispann ranfòse Rama, e li te kite travay li. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Alò, Wa Asa te mennen tout Juda, yo te retire wòch Rama yo avèk gwo bwa ki t ap sèvi pou bati yo, e avèk yo, li te ranfòse Guéba avèk Mitspa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Nan lè sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:1">I Wa 16:1</ref></char></note>Hanani, konseye a te vin kote Asa, wa Juda a. Li te di li: “Akoz ou te depann de wa Syrie a e ou pa t depann de SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, pou sa, lame wa Syrie a gen tan chape nan men ou. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Èske Etyopyen yo avèk Libyen yo pa t yon lame ki vast avèk anpil cha ak chevalye? Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:16-18">II Kwo 13:16-18</ref></char></note>akoz ou te depann de SENYÈ a, Li te livre yo nan men ou. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Paske zye a SENYÈ mache toupatou sou latè pou Li kapab bay soutyen ki fò a sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:17">II Kwo 15:17</ref></char></note>ki gen kè dedye a Li nèt yo. Nou te aji an foli nan afè sa a. Anverite, depi koulye a, nou va toujou gen gè.”<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Alò, Asa te fache avèk konseye a, e li te mete li nan prizon, paske li te anraje avèk li pou bagay sa a. Epi nan menm lè a, Asa te oprime kèk moun nan pèp la.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Alò, zèv Asa yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, veye byen, yo ekri nan Liv A Wa a Juda avèk Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Nan trant-nevyèm ane règn li a, Asa te vin malad nan pye li. Maladi a te grav, men menm nan maladi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:5">Jr 17:5</ref></char></note>li pa t chache SENYÈ a, men pito doktè. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Konsa, Asa te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo lè l fin mouri nan karanteyinyèm ane règn pa li a. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Yo te antere li nan pwòp tonm ke li te fouye pou li menm nan lavil David la, e yo te kouche li nan plas repo ke li te plen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:2">Jen 50:2</ref></char></note>avèk plizyè kalite epis ki te mele selon metye a yon moun ki konn fè pafen; epi yo te fè yon trè gwo dife pou li.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:24">I Wa 15:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Josaphat, fis li a te devni wa nan plas li, e li te fè pozisyon li sou Israël byen fèm. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Li te mete sòlda nan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:5">II Kwo 11:5</ref></char></note>vil fòtifye Juda yo, e li te fè ganizon militè nan peyi Juda avèk nan vil Éphraïm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:8">II Kwo 15:8</ref></char></note>ke papa li, Asa te kaptire yo. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />SENYÈ a te avèk Josaphat akoz li te swiv egzanp a zansèt li a, David, nan premye jou li yo, e li pa t chache Baal yo, <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />men li te chache Bondye a zansèt li yo. Li te swiv kòmandman li yo, e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref></char></note>pa t aji jan Israël te fè a. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Pou sa, SENYÈ a te etabli wayòm nan sou kontwòl li, tout Juda te pote pèyman bay Josaphat e li te vin gen gwo richès avèk lonè. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Li te fyè nan chemen SENYÈ a, e ankò li te rache wo plas yo avèk Asherim yo soti nan Juda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Konsa, nan twazyèm ane règn li a, li te voye reprezantan li yo, chèf Ben-Haïl yo, Abdias, Zacharie, Nethaneel, avèk Michée <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:3">II Kwo 15:3</ref></char></note>pou enstwi nan vil a Juda yo; <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />epi avèk yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:8">II Kwo 19:8</ref></char></note>Levit yo, Schemaeja, Nethania, Zebadia, Adonija, Tobija ak Tob-Adonija; epi avèk yo, prèt yo, Élischama avèk Joram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-9">Det 6:4-9</ref></char></note>Yo te enstwi Juda avèk liv lalwa SENYÈ a ke yo te genyen avèk yo. Konsa, yo te ale toupatou nan tout vil Juda yo pou te enstwi pami pèp la.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:14">II Kwo 14:14</ref></char></note>lakrent SENYÈ a te sou tout wayòm ki te antoure Juda yo, jiskaske yo pa t fè lagè kont Josaphat. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Kèk nan Filisten yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:14">II Kwo 9:14</ref></char></note>pote kado avèk lò kòm pèyman bay Josaphat. Arabyen yo tou te pote bann bèt ba li, sèt-mil-sèt-san belye ak sèt-mil-sèt-san mal kabrit. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Josaphat te vin grandi de plizanplis e li te bati fò avèk vil depo nan Juda. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Li te gen anpil depo nan vil a Juda yo ak gèrye yo, mesye ki plen kouraj Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Men kontwòl selon lakay a papa zansèt yo: nan Juda, chèf a dè milye yo, Adna, chèf la avèk twa-san-mil mesye plen kouraj; <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />epi akote li, Jochanan, chèf la, avèk de-san-katre-ven-mil mesye plen kouraj; <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />epi akote li, Amasia, fis a Zicri a, ki te konsakre volontèman a SENYÈ a, avèk de-san-mil mesye plen kouraj. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Pou Benjamin: Éliada, yon nonm plen kouraj, avèk de-san-mil mesye lame avèk banza ak boukliye defans, <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />epi akote li, Zozobad, avèk san-katreven-mil mesye pou fè lagè. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Se te sila ki te nan sèvis wa yo, yo pa menm konte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:2">II Kwo 17:2</ref></char></note>sila ke wa a te pozisyone nan tout vil fòtifye pami tout Juda yo.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Alò Josaphat te gen gwo richès avèk lonè; epi li te fè alyans avèk Achab pa maryaj. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:2-35">I Wa 22:2-35</ref></char></note>Kèk ane pita, li te desann kote Achab Samarie. Konsa, Achab te touye anpil mouton avèk bèf pou li avèk moun ki te avèk li yo, e li te konvenk li monte kont Ramoth-Galaad. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Achab, wa Israël la, te di a Josaphat, wa Juda a: “Èske ou va monte avèk mwen kont Ramoth-Galaad?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Konsa, li te di li: “Mwen tankou ou menm e pèp mwen an tankou pèp pa w la, nou avèk ou nan batay la.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Anplis, Josaphat te di a wa Israël la: “Souple, fè ankèt avan pou pawòl SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Epi wa Israël la te rasanble tout pwofèt yo, kat-san mesye. Li te di yo: “Èske nou dwe monte kont Ramoth-Galaad pou batay, oswa èske mwen dwe fè bak?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Epi yo te reponn: “Ale monte, paske Bondye va livre li nan men a wa a.”<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Men Josaphat te di: “Èske pa gen toujou yon pwofèt SENYÈ a pou nou kab mande sa?”<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: “Gen youn toujou ke nou kab fè demann a SENYÈ a, men mwen rayi li, paske li pa janm pwofetize sa ki bon pou mwen, men toujou, mal. Li se Michée, fis Jimla a.” Men Josaphat te di: “Pa kite wa a pale konsa.”<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Konsa, wa Israël la te rele yon ofisye e te di: “Fè vit, mennen Michée, fis Jimla a.”<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Alò, wa Israël la avèk Josaphat, wa Juda a te chita yo chak sou twòn yo, abiye ak manto yo. Yo te chita <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rt 4:1</ref></char></note>kote glasi vannen an nan antre pòtay Samarie a, epi tout pwofèt yo t ap pwofetize devan yo. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Sédécias, fis a Kenaana a, te fè kòn an fè pou kont li. Li te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, ‘Avèk sila yo, ou va frennen Siryen yo, jiskaske yo fin detwi nèt.’”<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Tout pwofèt yo t ap pwofetize konsa. Yo t ap di: “Ale monte Ramoth-Galaad e reyisi, paske SENYÈ a va livre li nan men a wa a.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Konsa, mesaje ki te ale fè demand prezans Michée a te pale avèk li. Li te di: “Gade byen, pawòl a pwofèt yo favorab nèt pou wa a. Konsa, souple, kite pawòl ou fèt tankou pa yo a e pale anfavè li.”<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Men Michée te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18-35">Nonb 22:18-35</ref></char></note>sa ke Bondye mwen an di, se sa mwen va pale.”<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Lè li te rive kote wa a, wa a te di li: “Michée, èske nou dwe monte Ramoth-Galaad pou batay la, oswa èske mwen dwe fè bak?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Li te di: “Ale monte e reyisi, paske yo va livre nan men ou.”<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Epi wa a te di li: “Konbyen fwa mwen oblije fè demann ke ou pa pale anyen sof ke laverite nan non SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Konsa, li te reponn: “Mwen te wè tout Israël gaye sou mòn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:4-8">És 35:4-8</ref></char></note>tankou mouton ki pa t gen bèje. Konsa, SENYÈ a te di: ‘Sila yo pa gen mèt. Kite yo chak retounen lakay yo anpè.’”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: “Èske mwen pa t di ou ke li pa t pwofetize sa ki bon pou mwen, men sa ki mal?”<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Michée te di: “Pou sa, tande pawòl SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1-5">És 6:1-5</ref></char></note>Mwen te wè SENYÈ a ki te chita sou twòn li an ak tout lame syèl la ki te kanpe adwat Li ak agoch Li. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />SENYÈ a te di: ‘Kilès k ap sedwi Achab, wa Israël la, pou monte tonbe Ramoth-Galaad?’ Epi youn te di sa, pandan yon lòt te di yon lòt bagay. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Alò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:16">Job 1:16</ref> </char></note> lespri te parèt e te kanpe devan SENYÈ a. Li te di: Mwen va sedwi li.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">“Epi SENYÈ a te di: ‘Kijan’?<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />“Li te reponn: ‘Mwen va ale fè l tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:44">Jn 8:44</ref></char></note>lespri manti nan bouch a tout pwofèt li yo.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">“Epi Li te di: ‘Ou dwe sedwi li e genyen li tou. Ale fè sa.’<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Alò, pou sa, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:14">És 19:14</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te mete yon lespri manti nan bouch a sila yo, pwofèt ou yo, paske SENYÈ a te pwoklame dega kont ou.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Konsa, Sédécias, fis a Kenaana a, te pwoche. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:2">Jr 20:2</ref></char></note>frape Michée sou machwè l e te di: “Ki kote chemen Lespri SENYÈ a te fè kite mwen pou pale avè w?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Michée te di: “Gade byen, nan jou ke ou antre nan chanm anndan pou kache kò ou la, ou va wè sa.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Alò, wa Israël la te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:8">II Kwo 18:8</ref></char></note>“Pran Michée e fè l retounen kote Amon, majistra vil la ak Joas, fis a wa a. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Di yo: ‘Konsa pale wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:10">II Kwo 16:10</ref></char></note>“Mete nonm sila a nan prizon a, e ba li tikras pen ak dlo jiskaske m retounen anpè.”’”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Michée te di: “Si, anverite, ou ta retounen anpè, SENYÈ a pa t vrèman pale avèk mwen.” Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:2">Mi 1:2</ref></char></note>“Koute byen, tout pèp yo!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Konsa, wa Israël avèk Josaphat, wa Juda a, te monte kont Ramoth-Galaad. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: “Mwen va kache idantite mwen pou antre nan batay la, e ou menm, mete pwòp manto ou.” Konsa, wa Israël la te kache idantite li, e yo te antre nan batay la. <verse eid="2CH 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Alò, wa Syrie a te kòmande chèf a cha li yo. Li te di: “Pa goumen avèk piti ni gran, men avèk wa Israël la sèlman.”<verse eid="2CH 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Pou sa, lè chèf a cha yo te wè Josaphat, yo te di: “Li se wa Israël la,” e yo te vire akote pou goumen kont li. Men Josaphat te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:14-15">II Kwo 13:14-15</ref></char></note>kriye anmwey, e SENYÈ a te fè l sekou. Bondye te angaje yo pou yo te kite l. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Lè chèf cha yo te wè ke se pa t wa Israël la, yo te retounen pa swiv li. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Yon sèten nonm te rale banza li pa aza, e te frape wa Israël la nan yon kwen nan pwotèj kò a. Konsa, li te pale a chofè cha a: “Vire tounen e fè m sòti nan batay la, paske mwen blese byen grav.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Batay la te chofe byen rèd tout jounen an e wa Israël te fòse pou l te kab kanpe nan cha li a devan Siryen yo jis rive nan aswè; epi nan kouche solèy la, li te mouri.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Konsa, Josaphat, wa a te retounen sof a lakay li Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Jéhu, fis a Hanani a, konseye a, te sòti pou rankontre li, e te di a Wa Josaphat: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:1-3">II Kwo 18:1-3</ref></char></note>“Èske ou ta dwe ede mechan yo, e renmen sila ki rayi SENYÈ yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:18">II Kwo 24:18</ref></char></note>konsa, kite lakòlè SENYÈ a vini sou ou? <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:12">II Kwo 12:12</ref></char></note>gen kèk bagay ki bon nan ou tou, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:6">II Kwo 17:6</ref></char></note>ou te retire Astarté a soti nan peyi ou a e ou te bay kè ou pou chache Bondye.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Konsa, Josaphat te rete Jérusalem e li te sòti deyò ankò pami pèp la soti Beer-Schéba jis rive nan peyi ti mòn a Éphraïm yo. Epi konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:8-13">II Kwo 15:8-13</ref></char></note>mennen yo retounen a SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Li te chwazi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:18-20">Det 16:18-20</ref></char></note>jij nan peyi a nan tout vil fòtifye Juda yo, vil pa vil. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Li te pale a jij yo: “Kontwole sa ke n ap fè a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref></char></note>nou pa jije pou yon moun, men pou SENYÈ ki avèk nou an pandan n ap rann jijman an. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Pou sa, kite lakrent SENYÈ a rete sou nou. Fè anpil atansyon nan sa n ap fè a, paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, p ap patisipe nan sa ki pa dwat, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17-18">Det 10:17-18</ref></char></note>patipri, ni nan lajan ki pase anba tab.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Nan Jérusalem osi, Josaphat te apwente <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:8-9">II Kwo 17:8-9</ref></char></note>kèk nan Levit yo avèk prèt yo ak kèk nan chèf lakay zansèt Israël yo, pou fè jijman SENYÈ a, e pou jije konfli pami moun ki te rete Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Li te pase lòd bay yo. Li te di: “Konsa nou va gen lakrent SENYÈ a, avèk fidelite e avèk tout kè. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:8">Det 17:8</ref></char></note>Nenpòt lè yon konfli rive devan nou soti nan manm fanmi nou yo ki rete nan vil yo, antre san ak san, antre lalwa avèk kòmandman yo, règleman avèk òdonans yo, nou va avèti yo pou yo pa vin koupab devan SENYÈ a, e pou kòlè pa rive sou nou avèk fanmi nou. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Kontwole byen, Amaria, chèf prèt la, va chèf sou nou nan tout sa ki apatyen a SENYÈ a, e Zebadia, fis Ismaël la, chèf lakay Juda a, nan tout sa ki apatyen a wa a. Osi, Levit yo va aji kòm ofisye devan nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:20">I Kwo 28:20</ref></char></note>Aji avèk kouraj, e SENYÈ a va avèk sila ki fè sa ki jis yo.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Alò, li te vin rive apre sa ke fis Moab yo avèk fis Ammon yo, ansanm avèk kèk nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:41">I Kwo 4:41</ref></char></note>Maonit yo te vini pou fè lagè kont Josaphat. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Kèk moun te vin bay rapò a Josaphat e te di: “Yon gran foul ap pwoche kont ou soti lòtbò lanmè Syrie. Gade byen, yo rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:7">Jen 14:7</ref></char></note>Hatsatson-Thamar” (ki En-Guédi a). <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Josaphat te byen pè. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">II Kwo 19:3</ref></char></note>vire atansyon li pou chache SENYÈ a, e te pwoklame yon jèn toupatou nan Juda. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Konsa, Juda te rasanble ansanm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:14">Jl 1:14</ref></char></note>chache èd SENYÈ a. Yo te sòti menm nan tout vil a Juda yo pou chache SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Konsa, Josaphat te kanpe nan asanble Juda a avèk Jérusalem, lakay SENYÈ a devan tribinal nèf la. <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />Li te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye a zansèt pa nou yo, èske se pa Ou menm ki Bondye nan Syèl yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:11">I Kwo 29:11</ref></char></note>Èske se pa Ou menm ki renye sou tout wayòm a nasyon yo? Pwisans avèk majeste, se nan men Ou, jiskaske nanpwen moun ki kab kanpe kont Ou. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Èske se pa Ou menm, O Bondye nou an, ki te chase tout sila ki te rete nan peyi sa a devan pèp Ou a, Israël pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">És 41:8</ref></char></note>bay li a desandan Abraham yo, zanmi Ou an, jis pou tout tan? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Yo te abite ladann, yo te bati sanktyè Ou a la pou non Ou, e yo te di: <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:28-30">II Kwo 6:28-30</ref></char></note>‘Si mechanste ta vini sou nou, nepe, oswa jijman, oswa epidemi, oswa gwo grangou, nou va kanpe devan kay sila a e devan Ou menm, (paske non pa Ou sou kay sa a) pou kriye a Ou menm nan twoub nou yo, ke Ou va tande pou delivre nou.’ <verse eid="2CH 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />Alò, gade, fis a Ammon yo avèk Moab avèk Mòn Séir, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:17-21">Nonb 20:17-21</ref></char></note>kilès ou te anpeche Israël pran lè yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la. Konsa, yo te vire akote e yo pa t detwi yo. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Gade, koulye a, jan y ap rekonpanse nou lè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:12">Sòm 83:12</ref></char></note>vin parèt pou chase nou mete deyò soti nan posesyon ke Ou te bannou kòm eritaj la. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />O Bondye nou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:27">Jij 11:27</ref></char></note>èske Ou p ap jije yo? Paske nou san pouvwa devan gran foul sila a k ap vini kont nou an. Ni nou pa konnen kisa pou nou fè, men zye nou ap gade sou Ou.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Tout Juda te kanpe devan SENYÈ a avèk ti bebe yo, madanm yo ak zanfan yo.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Alò, nan mitan asanble a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:1">II Kwo 15:1</ref></char></note>Lespri SENYÈ a te vini sou Jachaziel, fis a Zacharie a, fis a Benaja a, fis a Jeïel la, fis a Matthania a, Levit la ak fis a Asaph yo. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Epi li te di: “Koute, tout Juda avèk pèp Jérusalem nan ak Wa Josaphat: konsa pale SENYÈ a a nou menm: ‘Pa pè, ni pa pèdi kouraj akoz gran foul sila a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:47">I Sam 17:47</ref></char></note>batay la pa pou nou, men se pou Bondye li ye. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Demen, desann kont yo. Tande byen, yo va vin monte kote pant ti mòn Tsits lan, e nou va jwenn yo nan dènye pwent vale a devan dezè Jeruel la. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Nou pa bezwen goumen nan batay sila a. Pran pozisyon nou e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:13">Egz 14:13</ref></char></note>kanpe gade delivrans SENYÈ a anfavè nou, O Juda, avèk Jérusalem. Pa pè, ni pa pèdi kouraj. Demen sòti pou parèt devan yo, paske SENYÈ a avèk nou.’”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Josaphat te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:31">Egz 4:31</ref></char></note>bese tèt li jis atè, e tout Juda avèk moun Jérusalem yo te tonbe atè devan SENYÈ a, pou adore Li. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Levit ki te nan fis a Keatit yo, e nan fis a Koreyit yo, te kanpe pou louwe SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, nan yon trè gwo vwa.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Yo te leve granmmaten, e yo te sòti deyò nan dezè Tekoa a. Pandan yo tap sòti, Josaphat te kanpe. Li te di: “Koute mwen, O Juda avèk moun Jérusalem yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:9">És 7:9</ref></char></note>mete konfyans nou nan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, e nou va etabli. Mete konfyans nou nan pwofèt Li yo, e nou va vin reyisi.”<verse eid="2CH 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Lè li te fin konsilte pèp la, li te chwazi sila ki te chante a SENYÈ yo avèk sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:29">I Kwo 16:29</ref></char></note>fè louwanj nan vètman sen yo, pandan yo t ap sòti devan lame a. Yo t ap di: “Bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a, paske lanmou dous Li a dire jis pou tout tan.” <verse eid="2CH 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Depi lè a, yo te kòmanse chante ak bay louwanj, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:13">II Kwo 13:13</ref></char></note>mete anbiskad kont fis a Ammon yo, Moab avèk Mòn Séir, ki te vini kont Juda yo epi yo te vin boulvèse. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Paske fis Ammon yo avèk Moab yo te leve kont fis Mòn Séir yo pou te detwi yo nèt. Lè yo te fini avèk moun Mòn Séir yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:22">Jij 7:22</ref></char></note>asiste pou detwi youn lòt.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Lè Juda te rive nan wotè sou dezè a, yo te gade vè gwo foul la, epi vwala, te gen kadav ki te kouche atè a. Okenn pa t chape. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Lè Josaphat avèk pèp li a te vini pran piyaj la, yo te twouve anpil bagay pami yo; byen, vètman ak bagay valab ke yo te pran pou yo menm, plis pase yo ta kab pote. Yo te pran twa jou pou ranmase piyaj la, paske li te tèlman anpil. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Nan katriyèm jou a, yo te fè asanble nan vale Beraca a. La, yo te beni SENYÈ a. Akoz sa, yo te rele plas sa a: “Vale Beraca a” jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Tout mesye Juda avèk Jérusalem yo te retounen avèk Josaphat sou tèt la. Yo te retounen Jérusalem avèk kè kontan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:43">Né 12:43</ref> </char></note>paske SENYÈ a te fè yo rejwi sou lènmi yo. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Yo te vini Jérusalem avèk ap, gita yo ak twonpèt pou rive vè kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:14">II Kwo 14:14</ref></char></note>Lakrent Bondye te sou tout wayòm a lòt peyi yo lè yo te tande ke SENYÈ a te goumen kont lènmi Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Konsa, wayòm Josaphat a te gen lapè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:6-7">II Kwo 14:6-7</ref></char></note>paske Bondye li a te ba li repo tout kote.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:41-43">I Wa 22:41-43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Josaphat te renye sou Juda. Li te gen laj a trann-senk ane lè l te devni wa a e li te renye Jérusalem pandan venn-senkan. Non manman l se te Azuba, fi a Schilchi a. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Li te mache nan chemen papa li, Asa, e li pa t kite li. Li te toujou fè sa ki dwat nan zye SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:6">II Kwo 17:6</ref></char></note>wo plas yo pa t retire. Pèp la potko dirije kè yo vè Bondye a zansèt yo a.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Alò, tout lòt zèv a Josaphat yo, soti nan premye jis rive nan dènye a, gade byen, yo ekri nan rejis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:2">II Kwo 19:2</ref></char></note>Jéhu, fis a Hanani, ki enskri nan Liv Wa Israël Yo.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:48-49">I Wa 22:48-49</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre sa, Josaphat, wa Juda a te fè alyans avèk Achazia, wa Israël la. Li te aji mal nan fè bagay sa a. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Konsa, li te alinye li avèk li pou fè bato yo rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:21">II Kwo 9:21</ref></char></note>Tarsis e yo te fè bato yo rive nan Etsjon-Guéber. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Epi Éliézer, fis a Dodava a nan Maréscha, te pwofetize kont Josaphat. Li te di: “Akoz ou te fè alyans avèk Achazia, SENYÈ a te detwi zèv ou yo.” Pou sa, bato yo te kraze, e yo pa t kab ale Tarsis.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:50">I Wa 22:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Josaphat te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan vil David la; e Joram, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Joram te gen frè, fis a Josaphat yo: Azaria, Micaël, avèk Schephathia. Tout sila yo te fis a Josaphat, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:6">II Kwo 12:6</ref></char></note>Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Papa yo te ba yo anpil kado an ajan, lò, avèk bagay presye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:5">II Kwo 11:5</ref></char></note> avèk vil fòtifye nan Juda, men li te bay wayòm nan a Joram akoz li te premye ne. <verse eid="2CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Lè Joram te fin kontwole wayòm papa li, e te fè pozisyon li byen solid, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Jen 4:8</ref></char></note>touye tout frè li yo avèk nepe, ansanm ak kèk nan chèf Israël yo tou. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:17-22">II Wa 8:17-22</ref></char></note>Joram te gen trann-dezan lè l te devni wa e li te renye pandan uitan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-30">I Wa 12:28-30</ref></char></note>Li te mache nan chemen a wa Israël yo, menm jan avèk lakay Achab, (<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:1">II Kwo 18:1</ref></char></note>paske fi Achab la te madanm li) e li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Men SENYÈ a pa t vle detwi lakay David akoz akò ke Li te fè ak David la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-17">II Sam 7:12-17</ref></char></note>akoz Li te fè pwomès pou bay yon lanp pou li avèk fis li yo jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Pandan jou li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:22-23">II Kwo 20:22-23</ref></char></note>Édom te fè rebèl kont otorite Juda yo, e yo te etabli yon wayòm pou kont yo. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Konsa, Joram te travèse avèk chèf li yo ak tout cha li yo avèk li. Li te leve pandan nwit lan, e li te touye Edomit ki te antoure li yo, avèk chèf a cha yo. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Akoz sa, Édom te fè rebèl kont Juda jis rive Jodi a. Epi Libna te fè rebèl menm lè a kont otorite li, akoz li te bliye SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt li yo.<verse eid="2CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">I Wa 11:7</ref></char></note>li te fè wo plas nan mòn Juda yo. Li te fè pèp Jérusalem nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:5">Lev 20:5</ref></char></note>jwe pwostitisyon, e li te mennen Juda nan move wout. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Pou sa a, yon lèt te vin kote li soti nan men Élie, pwofèt la. Li te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt ou a, David: ‘Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:3-4">II Kwo 17:3-4</ref></char></note> ou pa t mache nan chemen a Josaphat, papa ou, ak nan chemen Asa, wa Juda a, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />men ou te mache nan chemen wa Israël yo, e ou te fè Juda avèk pèp Jérusalem nan jwe pwostitisyon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31-33">I Wa 16:31-33</ref></char></note>jan lakay Achab te jwe pwostitisyon an. Anplis, ou te touye frè ou yo, pwòp fanmi pa w, ki te pi bon pase ou. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Pou sa a, men gade, SENYÈ a va frape pèp ou a, fis ou yo, madanm ou yo ak tout byen ou yo avèk gwo malè. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:18-19">II Kwo 21:18-19</ref></char></note>Ou va vin soufri yon maladi ki rèd, yon maladi zantray ou, jiskaske zantray ou vin sòti akoz maladi a.’”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:11">II Kwo 17:11</ref> </char></note>boulvèse lespri Filisten yo kont Joram, ansanm ak Arab yo ki te nan lizyè Etyopyen yo. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Yo te vini kont Juda pou te atake li, e yo te fè pote ale tout posesyon ke yo te jwenn lakay wa a, ansanm avèk fis li yo, ak madanm li yo, jiskaske pa t gen fis ki te rete pou li, sof <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:23">II Kwo 25:23</ref></char></note>Joachaz, pi piti nan fis li yo.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Konsa, apre tout bagay sa a, SENYÈ a te frape li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:15">II Kwo 21:15</ref></char></note>nan zantray li avèk yon maladi ki pa t kab geri. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Alò, li te vin rive pandan tan ekoule a, nan fen dezan, ke zantray li te sòti akoz maladi li a, e li te mouri avèk gwo doulè. Epi pèp li a pa t fè dife pou li tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:14">II Kwo 16:14</ref></char></note>dife yo te fè pou papa zansèt li yo. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Li te gen trann-dezan lè l te vin wa e li te renye Jérusalem pandan uitan. Lè l te mouri li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18-28">Jr 22:18-28</ref></char></note>san regrè a pèsòn. Yo te antere li lavil David, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:25">II Kwo 24:25</ref> </char></note>men pa nan tonm a wa yo.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Pèp Jérusalem la te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:24-29">II Wa 8:24-29</ref></char></note>Achazia, pi piti fis li a, wa nan plas li, akoz bann mesye ki te vini ak Arab yo nan kan an te touye tout pi gran yo. Konsa Achazia, fis a Joram nan, wa Juda a te kòmanse renye. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Achazia te gen venn-dezan lè l te devni wa a e li te renye ennan Jérusalem. Non manman l te Athalie, fi a Omri. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Li menm tou te mache nan chemen lakay Achab yo, paske manman li te konseye li pou fè mal. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a tankou Achab, paske yo te konseye li apre lanmò papa l, jiskaske sa te fin detwi li. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Li te osi mache selon konsèy pa yo, e te ale avèk Joram, fis a Achab la, wa Israël la pou fè lagè kont Hazaël, wa Syrie a nan Ramoth-Galaad. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:28">II Wa 8:28</ref></char></note>Siryen yo te blese Joram. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Pou sa, li te retounen pou geri nan Jizreel akoz blese ke yo te ba li nan Rama yo, lè li te fin goumen kont Hazaël, wa Syrie a. Epi Achazia, fis a Joram nan, wa Juda a, te desann pou wè Joram, fis a Achab la Jizreel, akoz li te malad.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Alò, destriksyon Achazia te sòti nan Bondye akoz li te ale kote Joram. Paske lè l te desann, li te sòti avèk Joram kont Jéhu, fis a Nimschi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:6-7">II Wa 9:6-7</ref> </char></note>ke SENYÈ a te chwazi pou detwi lakay Achab. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:11-14">II Wa 10:11-14</ref></char></note>Li te vin rive ke lè Jéhu t ap egzekite jijman sou lakay Achab la, li te twouve chèf a Juda yo avèk fis a frè Achazia ki t ap sèvi Achazia yo, e li te touye yo. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:27">II Wa 9:27</ref></char></note>Anplis, li te chache Achazia, epi yo te kenbe li pandan li te kache Samarie a. Yo te mennen li kote Jéhu, yo te mete li a lanmò, e te antere li. Paske yo te di: “Li se fis a Josaphat, ki te chache SENYÈ a ak tout kè li a.” Konsa, pa t gen moun lakay Achazia pou te kenbe pouvwa wayòm nan.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">II Wa 11:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò lè Athalie, manman Achazia a, te wè ke fis li a te mouri, li te leve e te detwi tout pitit wa lakay Juda yo. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Men Joschabeath, fi a wa a te pran fis a Achazia a e te rache li soti nan mitan fis a wa a ke yo t ap touye yo, e li te plase li avèk nouris li nan chanm dòmi an. Konsa, Joschabeath, fi a Wa Joram nan, madanm a Jehojada, prèt la (paske li te sè Achazia), te kache li pou Athalie pa t kab mete l a lanmò. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Li te kache yo lakay SENYÈ a pandan sizan pandan Athalie t ap renye sou peyi a.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:4-20">II Wa 11:4-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan setyèm ane, Jehojada te ranfòse tèt li, e te pran chèf a dè santèn yo: Azaria, fis a Obed la, Maaséja, fis a Adaja a ak Élischaphath, fis a Zicri a. Yo te antre nan yon akò avèk li. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Yo te ale toupatou nan Juda pou te rasanble Levit soti nan tout vil Juda yo ak chèf lakay zansèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:13-17">II Kwo 11:13-17</ref></char></note>Israël yo, e yo te vini Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />Konsa, tout asanble a te fè yon akò avèk wa a nan kay Bondye a. Epi Jehojada te di yo: “Gade byen, fis a wa a oblije renye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">II Sam 7:12</ref></char></note>jan SENYÈ a te pale pa fis a David yo. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Sa se bagay ke nou oblije fè: yon tyè nan nou, nan prèt avèk Levit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:25">I Kwo 9:25</ref></char></note>ki antre nan Saba yo, va sèvi kòm gadyen pòtay; <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />yon tyè va kote lakay wa a, e yon tyè kote Pòtay Fondasyon an. Tout pèp la va nan lakou lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Men pa kite pèsòn antre lakay SENYÈ a, sof ke prèt avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:28-32">I Kwo 23:28-32</ref></char></note>Levit k ap fè sèvis yo. Yo kab antre, paske yo sen, men tout pèp la va kenbe règleman a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Levit yo va antoure wa a, chak mesye avèk zam yo nan men yo. Nenpòt moun ki antre nan kay la, fòk li mouri. Rete avèk wa a lè l antre ak lè l sòti.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Konsa, Levit yo avèk tout Juda te fè selon tout sa ke Jehojada, prèt la, te kòmande yo a. Yo chak te pran mesye pa yo ki te gen pou antre anndan nan Saba a, avèk sila ki t ap sòti nan Saba yo, paske Jehojada, prèt la, pa t lage okenn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:1">I Kwo 24:1</ref></char></note>divizyon sòlda yo. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Jehojada, prèt la, te bay a chèf dè santèn yo lans avèk gwo boukliye defans, ki te konn pou Wa David, ki te lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Li te estasyone tout pèp la, chak mesye yo avèk zam yo nan men yo, sòti nan kote dwat kay la jis rive nan kote goch kay la, toupre lotèl la, toupre kay la, antoure wa a nèt. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Epi yo te mennen fè parèt fis a wa a, yo te mete kouwòn nan sou li. Konsa, yo te ba li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16-21">Egz 25:16-21</ref></char></note>temwayaj pou te fè l wa. Jehojada avèk fis li yo te onksyone li, e yo te di ansanm: “Viv wa a!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Lè Athalie te tande bwi a pèp la ki t ap kouri ak bay lwanj a wa a, li te antre lakay SENYÈ a kote pèp la. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Li te gade e vwala, wa a te kanpe akote pilye li nan antre a, e chèf yo avèk mesye twonpèt yo te akote wa a. Epi tout pèp peyi a te rejwi. Yo te soufle twonpèt yo e chantè avèk enstriman yo pou dirije lwanj lan. Athalie te chire rad li, e te di: “Trayizon! Trayizon!”<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Jehojada, prèt la te mennen fè sòti chèf a dè santèn ki te chwazi sou lame yo. Li te di yo: “Mennen li deyò antre ranje yo, epi nenpòt moun ki swiv li, mete li a lanmò avèk nepe.” Paske prèt la te di: “Pa kite li mouri lakay SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Konsa, yo te sezi li e lè li te rive kote antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:28">Né 3:28</ref></char></note>Pòtay Cheval la, lakay wa a, yo te mete li a lanmò la.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:17">II Wa 11:17</ref></char></note>Jehojada te fè yon akò antre li menm avèk tout pèp la, e avèk wa a, pou yo ta pèp a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Konsa, tout pèp la te ale kote kay Baal la. Yo te chire, kase an mòso lotèl li yo, avèk imaj li yo, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:6-9">Det 13:6-9</ref></char></note>touye Matthan, prèt Baal la devan lotèl yo. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Anplis, Jehojada te mete ofisye lakay SENYÈ yo anba otorite prèt Levit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:6">I Kwo 23:6</ref></char></note>ke David te apwente sou lakay SENYÈ a, pou ofri ofrann brile a SENYÈ, jan sa ekri nan lalwa Moïse la—-avèk anpil rejwisans ak chante selon lòd a David la. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Li te estasyone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:22">I Kwo 9:22</ref></char></note>gadyen pòtay yo lakay SENYÈ a, pou pèsòn pa t kab antre, si pou nenpòt rezon li pa t pwòp. <verse eid="2CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:19">II Wa 11:19</ref></char></note>Li te pran chèf a dè santèn yo, moun enpòtan yo, moun ki te gouvène pèp la, tout pèp peyi a, e yo te mennen wa a desann soti lakay SENYÈ a pou te antre pa wo pòtay la pou antre lakay wa a. Konsa, yo te mete wa a sou twòn wayal la. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:20">II Wa 11:20</ref></char></note> Tout pèp peyi a te rejwi e vil la te vin kalm. Paske yo te mete Athalie a lanmò avèk nepe.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:21">II Wa 11:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joas te gen laj setan lè l te devni wa, e li te renye pandan karantan Jérusalem, Non manman li te Tsibja soti nan Beer-Schéba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:4-5">II Kwo 26:4-5</ref></char></note>Joas te fè sa ki te bon nan zye SENYÈ a pandan tout jou a Jehojada yo, prèt la. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Jehojada te pran de madanm pou li, e li te vin papa a fis ak fi.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Li te vin rive apre sa ke Joas te pran desizyon pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:7">II Kwo 24:7</ref></char></note>restore lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Li te rasanble prèt yo avèk Levit yo, e li te di yo: “Ale antre nan tout vil Juda yo e rekeyi lajan pami tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:2">II Kwo 21:2</ref></char></note>Israël pou repare lakay SENYÈ nou an chak ane. Epi fè sa byen vit.” Men Levit yo pa t aji avèk vitès. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Akoz sa, wa a te rele Jehojada, chèf prèt la. Li te mande li: “Poukisa nou pa t egzije Levit yo pou pote soti Juda avèk Jérusalem <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:12-16">Egz 30:12-16</ref></char></note>taks etabli pa Moïse la, sèvitè SENYÈ a sou asanble Israël la pou tant temwayaj la?” <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:17">II Kwo 21:17</ref></char></note>fis a Athalie yo, ki te tèlman mechan, te antre kase lakay Bondye a. Anplis yo te sèvi ak bagay sen nan kay yo pou sèvi Baal.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Konsa, wa a te pase lòd e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:9">II Wa 12:9</ref></char></note>yo te fè yon bwat kès pou te mete li deyò akote pòtay lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:22">II Kwo 36:22</ref></char></note>Yo te fè yon pwoklamasyon nan Juda avèk Jérusalem pou pote bay SENYÈ a, taks Moïse la, sèvitè Bondye a, ki te etabli nan dezè a pou Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Tout ofisye yo avèk tout pèp la te rejwi. Yo te pote taks pa yo e yo te depoze yo nan kès la jiskaske yo te ranpli l. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Li te vin rive ke nenpòt lè Levit yo te pote kès la anndan kote ofisye wa a yo, e lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:10">II Wa 12:10</ref></char></note>yo te wè ke te gen anpil lajan, ke grefye a wa a avèk ofisye a chèf prèt la te vin vide kès la, pran l e remete li nan plas li. Konsa, yo te fè chak jou, e yo te rekeyi anpil lajan. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Wa a avèk Jehojada te bay li a sila ki te fè travay nan sèvis lakay SENYÈ a. Yo te anplwaye mason avèk chapant pou restore lakay SENYÈ a, ak ouvriye, fè, avèk bwonz pou repare lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Konsa, ouvriye yo te travay, epi èv reparasyon an te avanse nan men yo. Yo te restore lakay Bondye a selon plan li, e yo te ranfòse li. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Lè yo te fini, yo te mennen rès lajan an devan wa a avèk Jehojada. Li te fonn pou fè zouti pou lakay SENYÈ a, zouti pou sèvis la ak ofrann brile a, avèk po ak zouti an lò avèk ajan. Epi yo te ofri ofrann brile yo lakay SENYÈ a san rete pandan tout jou a Jehojada yo.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Alò, lè Jehojada te rive a yon gwo laj byen mi, li te vin mouri. Li te gen san-trantan lè l te mouri. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Yo te antere li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:20">II Kwo 21:20</ref></char></note>lavil David pami wa yo akoz li te fè byen an Israël ni pou Bondye, ni pou lakay Li a.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Men apre lanmò Jehojada, ofisye Juda yo te vini bese ba devan wa a, e wa a te koute yo. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Yo te abandone lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt yo a pou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-14">Egz 34:12-14</ref></char></note>sèvi Asherim yo avèk zidòl yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:20">Jos 22:20</ref></char></note>lakòlè SENYÈ a te desann sou Juda avèk Jérusalem akoz koupabilite sa a. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Malgre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:25">Jr 7:25</ref></char></note>Li te voye pwofèt yo kote yo pou mennen yo retounen a SENYÈ a. Sepandan, yo te fè temwayaj kont yo, e te refize koute yo.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:14">II Kwo 20:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò Lespri Bondye a te vini sou Zacharie, fis a Jehojada a, prèt la. Li te kanpe anwo pèp la, e te pale yo: “Konsa Bondye te di: ‘Poukisa nou vyole kòmandman a SENYÈ la, e akoz sa nou pa reyisi? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:2">II Kwo 15:2</ref></char></note>Akoz nou te abandone SENYÈ a, Li menm osi te abandone nou.’”<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:26">Né 9:26</ref></char></note>yo te fè konplo kont li. Sou kòmand a wa a, yo te lapide li jiska lanmò nan lakou lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Konsa, Joas pa t sonje bonte ke papa li, Jehojada te montre li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:5">Jen 9:5</ref></char></note>men li te touye fis li. Epi pandan li t ap mouri, li te di: “Ke SENYÈ a wè e fè revandikasyon!”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Alò, li te vin rive nan fen ane ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:17">II Wa 12:17</ref></char></note>lame Siryen yo te monte kont li. Yo te vini Juda avèk Jérusalem, e te detwi tout ofisye a pèp la ki te pami pèp la, epi yo te voye tout piyaj la kote wa a Damas la. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Anverite, lame Siryen an te vini avèk yon ti kantite moun, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:7-8">II Kwo 16:7-8</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te livre yon trè gwo lame nan men yo, paske yo te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt yo a. Se konsa yo te egzekite jijman sou Joas.<verse eid="2CH 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 12:20-21">II Wa 12:20-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè yo te kite Joas, (akoz yo te kite li byen blesi), pwòp sèvitè li yo te fè konplo kont li akoz san fis Jehojada a, prèt la, e yo te asasine li sou kabann li an. Konsa, li te mouri e yo te antere li lavil David la, men yo pa t antere li nan tonm a wa yo. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Alò, sa yo se sila ki te fè konplo kont li yo: Zabad, fis a Schimeath la, Amonit lan, ak Jozabad, fis a Schimrith la, Moabit la. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Konsènan fis li yo, tout pawòl madichon kont li yo ak rekonstriksyon lakay Bondye a, gade byen, yo ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:22">II Kwo 13:22</ref></char></note>istwa Liv A Wa Yo. Epi Amatsia, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:1-6">II Wa 14:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amatsia te gen laj a venn-senkan lè l te devni wa, e li te renye vent-nevan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Joaddan de Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Li te fè sa ki dwat nan zye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:14">II Kwo 25:14</ref></char></note>sepandan, pa avèk tout kè l. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:5">II Wa 14:5</ref></char></note>li te vin rive depi wayòm nan te byen solid nan men l, ke li te touye sèvitè li yo ki te touye papa li, wa a. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Sepandan, li pa t touye pitit yo, men li te swiv sa ki ekri nan lalwa nan liv Moïse la, ke SENYÈ a te kòmande, ki te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Det 24:16</ref></char></note>“Papa yo p ap mete a lanmò pou fis yo, ni fis yo p ap mete a lanmò pou papa yo, men chak moun va mete a lanmò pou pwòp peche pa l.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Anplis, Amatsia te rasanble Juda, e li te òganize yo selon lakay papa yo anba chèf a dè milye e chèf a dè santèn toupatou nan Juda avèk Benjamin. Li te pran yon kontwòl global a sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:3">Nonb 1:3</ref></char></note>soti nan ventan oswa plis yo, e li te twouve yo a twa-san-mil mesye, byen chwazi pou fè lagè ak manyen lans ak pwotèj. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Li te anplwaye osi san-mil gèrye plen kouraj ki sòti an Israël pou san talan ajan. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Men yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:9">II Wa 4:9</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye te rive kote li e te di: “O Wa, pa kite lame Israël la ale avèk ou, paske SENYÈ a pa avèk Israël, ni avèk okenn nan fis Éphraïm yo. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Men si ou ale, aji avèk fòs pou batay la. Bondye va rale ou desann devan lènmi yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">II Kwo 14:11</ref></char></note>paske Bondye gen pouvwa pou ede e pou desann.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amatsia te di a nonm Bondye a: “Men kisa n ap fè pou afè san talan ke m te bay a sòlda Israël yo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Nonm Bondye a te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:18">Det 8:18</ref></char></note>“Senyè a gen bokou plis pou bay pase sa.”<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Konsa, Amatsia te voye yo ale, sòlda ki te rive kote li soti Éphraïm yo, pou rive lakay yo. Akoz sa a, kòlè yo te brile kont Juda e yo te retounen lakay ak gwo kòlè.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Alò, Amatsia te ranfòse tèt li; li te mennen pèp li a sòti pou ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:7">II Wa 14:7</ref></char></note>Vale Sèl la, e te frape di-mil nan fis a Séir yo. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Fis a Juda yo, anplis, te kaptire di-mil tou vivan. Yo te mennen yo anwo pwent falèz la, e te jete yo anba soti anwo falèz la, jiskaske yo tout te kraze chire an mòso. <verse eid="2CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Men sòlda ke Amatsia te voye retounen pou yo pa ale nan batay la avèk li yo, te atake vil a Juda yo, soti Samarie jis rive Beth-Horon. Yo te frape twa-mil nan yo, e te piyaje anpil byen yo.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Alò, lè Amatsia te sòti nan masak Edomit yo, li te pote dye a fis a Séir yo. Li te pozisyone yo tankou dye pa li, pou l bese ba devan yo e te brile lansan a yo menm. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Lakòlè Bondye te brile kont Amatsia, e Li te voye pwofèt Li ki te di l: “Poukisa ou te swiv dye a pèp sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:11-12">II Kwo 25:11-12</ref></char></note>ki pa t kab delivre pwòp pèp pa yo nan men ou?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Pandan li t ap pale avèk li, wa a te di li: “Èske nou te chwazi ou menm kòm konseye wayal? Rete! Poukisa w ap chache mouri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Epi pwofèt la te rete. Li te di: “Mwen konnen ke Bondye deja fè plan pou detwi ou, paske ou te fè bagay sa a e pa t koute konsèy mwen.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:8-14">II Wa 14:8-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Amatsia, wa Juda a te pran konsèy moun pa l. Li te voye kote Joas, fis a Joachaz la, fis a Jéhu a, wa Israël la. Li te di l: “Vini, annou parèt fasafas.”<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Joas, wa Israël la te voye kote Amatsia, wa Juda a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:8-15">Jij 9:8-15</ref></char></note>“Bwa pikan ki te Liban an te voye kote bwa sèd ki te Liban an, e te di: ‘Bay fi ou a fis mwen nan maryaj.’ Men yon bèt sovaj nan Liban te pase akote e te foule bwa pikan an. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Ou di nan tèt ou: ‘Gade byen, mwen te bat Édom.’ Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16">II Kwo 26:16</ref></char></note>kè ou vin plen ak ògèy e anfle. Alò, rete lakay ou! Poukisa ou ta pwovoke twoub pou tèt ou, jiskaske ou menm, ou ta tonbe e Juda avèk ou?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Men Amatsia pa t ap koute, paske sa te soti nan Bondye, ki ta livre yo nan men lèdmi yo, akoz yo te chache dye Édom yo. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Konsa Joas, wa Israël la te monte, e li menm avèk Amatsia, wa Juda a te fè fasafas nan Beth-Schémesch, ki te pou Juda a. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Juda te bat pa Israël, e yo chak te kouri nan pwòp tant yo.<verse eid="2CH 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Alò Joas, wa Israël la te kaptire Amatsia, wa Juda a, fis a Joas la, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:17">II Kwo 21:17</ref></char></note>Joachaz la, nan Beth-Schémesch. Li te mennen li Jérusalem, e li te chire miray Jérusalem nan soti nan Pòtay Éphraïm nan jis rive nan Pòtay Kwen an, kat-san koude nan longè. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Li te pran tout lò avèk ajan ak tout zouti ki te twouve lakay Bondye a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:15">I Kwo 26:15</ref></char></note>Obed-Édom ak trezò lakay wa a, ansanm avèk prizonye yo, e te retounen Samarie.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:17-22">II Wa 14:17-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi Amatsia, fis a Joas la, wa Juda a, te viv kenzan apre lanmò Joas, fis a Joachaz la, wa Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Alò, tout lòt zèv a Amatsia yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, men gade, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv A Wa Juda Avèk Israël yo? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Depi lè ke Amatsia te vire kite SENYÈ a, yo te fè konplo kont li Jérusalem, e li te sove ale Lakis, men yo te voye dèyè li Lakis e te touye li la. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Konsa, yo te mennen li sou cheval e te antere li avèk zansèt li yo lavil Juda.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Tout pèp Juda a te pran Ozias, ki te genyen laj a sèzan e te fè li wa nan plas a papa li, Amatsia. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Li te bati Élath e te restore li pou Juda apre wa a te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Ozias te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:2-3">II Wa 15:2-3</ref></char></note>sèzan lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye pandan senkann-dezan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Jecolia, de Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Li te fè sa ki bon nan zye a SENYÈ a selon tout sa ke papa li, Amatsia te konn fè. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:2">II Kwo 24:2</ref></char></note>Li te kontinye chache Bondye nan tout jou a Zacharie yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref></char></note>ki te gen konprann selon vizyon Bondye. Pandan tout tan li t ap chache SENYÈ a, Bondye te fè l reyisi.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Alò, li te sòti pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29">És 14:29</ref></char></note>lagè kont Filisten yo. Li te kraze miray a Gath la, miray a Jabné a, miray a Asdod la, e li te bati vil nan anviwon Asdod pami Filisten yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:16">II Kwo 21:16</ref></char></note>Bondye te ede li kont Filisten yo, e kont Arab ki te rete Gur-Baal yo, avèk Maonit yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Anplis, Amonit yo te peye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:11">II Kwo 17:11</ref></char></note>taks obligatwa a Ozias, e rekonesans li te rive jis nan lizyè Égypte. Li te vin pwisan anpil. <verse eid="2CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Anplis, Ozias te bati fò Jérusalem yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:23">II Kwo 25:23</ref></char></note>Pòtay Kwen an, nan Pòtay Vale a ak nan kwen pilye a pou ranfòse yo toujou. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Li te bati fò nan dezè yo, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:18-21">Jen 26:18-21</ref></char></note>fouye anpil sitèn, paske li te gen anpil bèt, ni nan ba plèn nan, ni nan gran plèn nan. Anplis, li te genyen labourè chan yo avèk moun pou pran swen chan rezen nan peyi ti kolin yo ak nan chan bon tè yo, paske li te renmen latè anpil. <verse eid="2CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Anplis, Ozias te gen yon lame parèt pou batay, ki te antre nan konba a pa divizyon yo selon nimewo pa yo, prepare pa Jeïel, sekretè a, avèk Maaséja, ofisye a, anba direksyon a Hanania, youn nan ofisye wa yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Nonb total a chèf lakay yo, a gèrye plen kouraj yo te de-mil-sis-san. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Anba direksyon pa yo, te gen yon lame elit de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:5">II Kwo 25:5</ref></char></note>twa-san-sèt-mil-senk-san ki te kapab fè lagè avèk gwo pouvwa, pou bay wa a soutyen kont lènmi an. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Anplis, Ozias te prepare pou tout lame a boukliye defans yo, lans yo, kas yo, abiman defans kò yo, banza yo ak wòch fistibal yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Nan Jérusalem, li te fè gwo machin lagè envante pa moun gwo kapasite pou plase sou fò yo pou tire flèch avèk gwo wòch. Pou tout sa, rekonesans li te gaye byen lwen, paske li te resevwa gwo èd jiskaske li te vin byen pwisan.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Men lè l te vin fò, kè li te vin plen ògèy. Li te aji konwonpi. Li pa t fidèl a SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:1-4">I Wa 13:1-4</ref></char></note>li te antre nan tanp SENYÈ a pou brile lansan sou lotèl lansan an. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:10">I Kwo 6:10</ref></char></note>Azaria, prèt la, te antre dèyè li avèk katreven prèt SENYÈ a, mesye ki te plen kouraj. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:2">II Kwo 19:2</ref></char></note>Yo te konfwonte Ozias, wa a. Yo te di li: “Se pa ou menm, Ozias, ki pou brile lansan a SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7-8">Egz 30:7-8</ref></char></note>men se prèt yo, fis a Aaron ki konsakre pou brile lansan. Sòti nan sanktyè a, paske ou gen tò, e ou p ap twouve lonè devan SENYÈ a, Bondye a.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Men Ozias, avèk veso lansanswa nan men l pou brile lansan an, te anraje. Konsa, pandan li te anraje avèk prèt yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:25-27">II Wa 5:25-27</ref></char></note>lalèp te pete sou fon li devan prèt yo lakay SENYÈ a, akote lotèl lansan an. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Azaria, chèf prèt la avèk tout lòt prèt yo te gade li, e vwala, li te gen lalèp sou fon li. Konsa, yo te fè l sòti la byen vit, e li menm tou te fè vit pou sòti akoz SENYÈ a te frape li. <verse eid="2CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:5-7">II Wa 15:5-7</ref></char></note>Wa Ozias te rete yon moun lalèp jis rive nan jou li te mouri an. Li te rete nan yon kay apa, akoz lalèp la, paske li te entèdi antre lakay SENYÈ a. Jotham, fis li a, te lakay wa a pou te jije pèp peyi a.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Alò, tout rès a zèv Ozias yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, pwofèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:1">És 1:1</ref> </char></note>Ésaïe, fis a Amots la, te ekri yo. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Konsa, Ozias te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li avèk papa zansèt li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:20">II Kwo 21:20</ref></char></note>nan chan akote tonm ki te pou wa yo, paske yo te di: “Li gen lalèp”. Epi Jotham, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:33-35">II Wa 15:33-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jotham te gen laj venn-senkan lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye sèzan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Jeruscha, fis a Tsadok la. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Li te fè sa ki dwat nan zye SENYÈ a, selon tout sa ke papa Ozias te konn fè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16">II Kwo 26:16</ref></char></note>Men li pa t antre nan tanp SENYÈ a. E pèp la te kontinye aji konwonpi. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Li te bati pòtay pi wo lakay SENYÈ a, e li te bati anpil menm sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:14">II Kwo 33:14</ref></char></note>miray Ophel la. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Anplis, li te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:5">II Kwo 11:5</ref></char></note>vil nan peyi kolin a Juda yo, e li te bati fò avèk fòterès sou ti kolin ki te bwaze yo. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Li te goumen osi avèk wa Amonit yo, e li te genyen yo jiskaske Amonit yo te ba li nan menm ane sa a, san talan an ajan, di-mil barik ble ak di-mil barik lòj. Amonit yo te peye li menm fòs sa a nan dezyèm ak twazyèm ane a. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:5">II Kwo 26:5</ref></char></note>Konsa, Jotham te vin trè pwisan akoz li te fè afè li an lòd devan SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. <verse eid="2CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:36">II Wa 15:36</ref></char></note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jotham yo, menm tout gè li yo avèk zèv li yo, gade byen, yo ekri nan Liv A Wa Israël Avèk Juda Yo. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 27:1">II Kwo 27:1</ref></char></note>venn-senkan lè l te vin wa e li te renye sèzan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Konsa, Jotham te dòmi avèk papa zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li lavil David. Achaz, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:2-4">II Wa 16:2-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Achaz te gen laj a ventan lè l te devni wa e li te renye sèzan Jérusalem. Li pa t fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a, jan David, papa zansèt li a, te konn fè a, <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />men li te mache nan chemen a wa Israël yo. Anplis, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:17">Egz 34:17</ref></char></note>fè imaj fonn pou Baal yo. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:8">Jos 15:8</ref></char></note>Li te brile lansan nan vale Ben-Hinnon e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref></char></note>brile fis li yo nan dife, selon abominasyon a nasyon ke SENYÈ a te chase mete deyò devan fis Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Li te fè sakrifis e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:25">II Kwo 28:25</ref></char></note>brile lansan sou wo plas yo, sou ti mòn yo e anba chak bwa vèt.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:24">II Kwo 24:24</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, te livre li nan men a wa Syrie. Konsa, yo te bat li e te pote ale de li yon gran kantite kaptif pou te fè yo rive Damas. Li te anplis livre nan men a wa Israël la ki te aflije li avèk anpil moun mouri. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">II Wa 16:5</ref></char></note>Pékach, fis Remalia a, te touye nan Juda, pandan yon sèl jou, san-ven-mil òm, tout mesye ki plen kouraj yo, akoz yo te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt yo. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Epi Zicri yon nonm pwisan nan Éphraïm, te touye Maaséja, fis a wa a avèk Azrikam, chèf a kay wayal la, e Elkana, dezyèm apre wa a. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:25-41">Det 28:25-41</ref></char></note>Fis Israël yo te pote ale an kaptivite pami frè yo de-san-mil fanm Judah, fis ak fi. Anplis yo te pran anpil piyaj ki sòti nan yo, e te mennen piyaj la Samarie. <verse eid="2CH 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Men yon pwofèt SENYÈ a ki te rele Oded te la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:15">II Kwo 25:15</ref></char></note>Li te sòti deyò pou rankontre lame ki te vini Samarie a e li te di yo: “Gade byen, paske SENYÈ a zansèt ou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:6">És 47:6</ref></char></note>te fache avèk Juda, Li te livre yo nan men nou, e nou te touye yo ak gwo laraj ki te rive jis nan syèl la. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Alò, nou ap pwopoze pou fè pou kont nou, pèp a Juda avèk Jérusalem yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref></char></note>vin soumèt kòm esklav mal ak femèl. Anverite, èske nou menm pa gen transgresyon pou kont nou kont SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Alò, pou sa, koute mwen e remèt kaptif ke nou te fè prizonye pami frè nou yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:13">Jc 2:13</ref></char></note>paske kòlè SENYÈ a byen cho kont nou.” <verse eid="2CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Alò, kèk nan chèf a fis Éphraïm yo——Azaria, fis a Jochanan nan, Bérékia, fis a Meschillémoth la, Ézéchias, fis a Schallum nan e Amasa, fis a Hadlaï a——te leve kont sila ki t ap retounen soti nan batay la. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Yo te di yo: “Fòk nou pa mennen kaptif yo anndan isit la, paske nou ap tante mennen sou nou koupabilite kont SENYÈ a, ki va ogmante peche nou avèk koupabilite nou. Paske koupabilite nou vin tèlman gran ke kòlè Li vin kont Israël.”<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Pou sa, mesye ki t ap pote zam yo te kite kaptif yo avèk piyaj la devan ofisye yo avèk tout asanble a. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Epi mesye ki te chwazi pa non yo te leve, pran kaptif yo, yo te mete rad ki sòti nan piyaj la sou sila ki te toutouni yo. Yo te bay yo rad avèk sandal, yo te bay yo manje e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Pwov 25:21-22</ref></char></note>bay yo bwè, e yo te onksyone yo avèk lwil. Yo te mennen tout sila ki te fèb yo sou bourik e te fè yo rive Jéricho, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:3">Det 34:3</ref></char></note>vil palmis yo, kote frè yo. Konsa, yo te retounen Samarie.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:7">II Wa 16:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan lè sa a, Wa Achaz te voye kote wa Asiryen yo pou jwenn soutyen. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="OBA 1:10">Ab 10</ref></char></note> Paske ankò, Edomit yo te vin atake Juda e te mennen yo sòti kaptif. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:57">Éz 16:57</ref></char></note>Filisten yo osi te atake vil nan ba plèn yo avèk Negev nan Juda e te pran Beth-Schémesch, Ajalon, Guedéroth, Soco avèk vil pa li yo, Thimna avèk vil pa li yo e Guimzo avèk vil pa li yo, epi yo te vin abite la. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />Paske SENYÈ a te imilye Juda akoz Achaz, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:2">II Kwo 21:2</ref></char></note>Israël la. Paske li te fè rive yon mank de lòd nan Juda e te manke fidèl anpil a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:26">I Kwo 5:26</ref></char></note>Tilgath-Piléser, wa Assyrie a te vini kont li, e te aflije li olye de ranfòse li. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:8-9">II Wa 16:8-9</ref></char></note>Sepandan, Achaz te pran yon pòsyon sòti nan kay SENYÈ a e sòti nan palè wa a ak chèf yo pou te bay li a wa Assyrie a, men sa pa t ede li.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Alò, nan tan gwo pwoblèm pa li, menm Wa Achaz sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:3">Jr 5:3</ref></char></note>te vin peche plis devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:14">II Kwo 25:14</ref></char></note>Paske li te fè sakrifis a lòt dye Damas yo ki te bat li yo. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:17-18">Jr 44:17-18</ref></char></note>“Akoz dye a wa Syrie yo te ede yo, mwen va fè sakrifis de yo pou yo kab ede mwen.” Men yo te koze chit li avèk tout Israël. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Anplis, lè Achaz te ranmase ansanm tout zouti lakay Bondye yo, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:17">II Wa 16:17</ref></char></note>te koupe tout zouti yo an mòso. Li te fèmen pòt lakay SENYÈ a, e te fè lotèl pou li nan chak kwen nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Nan chak vil nan Juda, li te fè wo plas pou brile lansan a lòt dye yo, e li te pwovoke SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt li yo, a lakòlè.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:19-20">II Wa 16:19-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout lòt zèv avèk chemen li yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, men gade byen, yo ekri nan Liv A Wa A Juda yo Avèk Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:28">És 14:28</ref></char></note>Konsa, Achaz te dòmi avèk papa zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li nan vil Jérusalem nan; paske yo pa t mennen li antre nan tonm a wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:2">II Kwo 21:2</ref> </char></note>Israël yo. Epi Ézéchias, fis li a, te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">II Wa 18:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ézéchias te devni wa a laj venn-senkan. Li te renye pandan vent-nevan Jérusalem. Non manman li te Abija, fi Zacharie a. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:1">II Kwo 28:1</ref></char></note>Li te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a selon tout sa ke papa zansèt li a, David te fè. <verse eid="2CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Nan premye ane règn li a, nan premye mwa a, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">II Kwo 28:24</ref></char></note>ouvri pòt lakay SENYÈ a e te repare yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Li te mennen prèt yo avèk Levit yo, e te rasanble yo nan plas sou lès la. <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />Konsa, li te di yo: “Koute mwen, O Levit yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:15-34">II Kwo 29:15-34</ref></char></note>Konsakre nou menm koulye a, konsakre lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt nou yo, e pote sa ki pa pwòp deyò pou l vin yon lye sen. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Paske papa nou yo pa t fidèl. Yo te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ Bondye nou an. Yo te abandone Li, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:16">Éz 8:16</ref></char></note>vire fas yo lwen plas kote SENYÈ a rete a. Yo te vire do yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Anplis, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">II Kwo 28:24</ref></char></note>fèmen pòt sou galeri yo, etenn lanp yo, e yo pa t brile lansan ni ofri ofrann brile nan lye sen Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20">II Kwo 24:20</ref></char></note>kòlè SENYÈ a te kont Juda avèk Jérusalem, e Li te fè yo vin yon objè gwo etonman abominab avèk laperèz ak siflèt ki fèt sou yo, jan nou wè avèk pwòp zye nou an. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Paske gade byen, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:5-8">II Kwo 28:5-8</ref></char></note>papa zansèt nou yo fin tonbe anba nepe, e fis yo avèk fi yo avèk madanm nou yo vin nan esklavaj akoz sa. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Alò, sa nan kè m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:16">II Kwo 23:16</ref></char></note>pou fè yon akò avèk SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, pou chalè kòlè Li a kapab detounen kite nou. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Fis mwen yo, koulye a, pa kite nou vin lach nan moman sa a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:6">Nonb 3:6</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te chwazi nou pou kanpe devan L, pou fè sèvis pou Li, pou devni sèvitè Li epi brile lansan.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Konsa, Levit yo te leve: Machath, fis a Amasaï a, Joël, fis a Azaria a, soti nan fis a Keatit yo; epi soti nan fis a Merari yo, Kis, fis a Abdi a, Azaria, fis a Jehalléleel la; epi soti nan Gèshonit yo, Joach, fis a Zimma a, Éden, fis a Joach la; <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />epi soti nan fis a Élitsaphan yo, Schimri avèk Jeïel, fis a Asapah yo, Zacharie avèk Matthania; <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />epi soti nan fis a Héman yo, Jehiel avèk Schimeï; epi soti nan fis a Jeduthun yo, Schemaeja avèk Uzziel. <verse eid="2CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Yo te rasanble frè yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:5">II Kwo 29:5</ref></char></note>konsakre yo menm, e te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:28">I Kwo 23:28</ref></char></note>pou netwaye lakay SENYÈ a, selon kòmandman a wa a, selon pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Pou sa, prèt yo te antre nan pati enteryè lakay SENYÈ a pou netwaye li, epi chak bagay yo te twouve ki pa t pwòp nan tanp SENYÈ a, yo te mete li deyò nan lakou lakay SENYÈ a. Depi la, Levit yo te resevwa l pou pote l rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:16">II Kwo 15:16</ref></char></note>Vale Cédron an. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Alò, yo te kòmanse fè konsekrasyon an, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:3">II Kwo 29:3</ref></char></note>nan premye jou, nan premye mwa a, e nan uityèm jou nan mwa a, yo te rive sou galeri SENYÈ a. Konsa, yo te konsakre lakay SENYÈ a nan ui jou e yo te fini sou sèzyèm jou nan premye mwa a. <verse eid="2CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Alò, yo te antre kote Wa Ézéchias la, e yo te di: “Nou fin netwaye tout kay SENYÈ a, lotèl ofrann brile a avèk tout zouti li yo ak tab pen konsakre a avèk tout zouti li yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">II Kwo 28:24</ref></char></note>tout zouti ke Wa Achaz te abandone pandan règn enfidèl li a, nou te fin prepare e konsakre yo. Epi vwala, yo la devan lotèl SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Konsa, Wa Ézéchias te leve bonè. Li te rasanble chèf lavil yo, e te monte vè lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Yo te mennen sèt towo, sèt belye, sèt jèn mouton ak sèt mal kabrit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:3-14">Lev 4:3-14</ref></char></note>kòm ofrann peche pou wayòm nan, pou sanktyè a ak pou Juda. Epi li te kòmande prèt yo, fis a Aaron yo, pou ofri yo sou lotèl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Konsa, yo te touye towo yo. Prèt yo te pran san an e te aspèje li sou lotèl la. Anplis, yo te touye belye yo, e te aspèje san an sou lotèl la. Yo te touye, osi, jèn mouton yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:18">Lev 4:18</ref></char></note>aspèje san an sou lotèl la. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Alò, yo te mennen mal kabrit yo pou ofrann peche devan wa a avèk asanble a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:15">Lev 4:15</ref></char></note>yo te poze men sou yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Prèt yo te touye yo, e te lave lotèl la avèk san yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:26">Lev 4:26</ref></char></note>pou fè ekspiyasyon pou tout Israël, paske wa a te kòmande ofrann brile avèk ofrann peche pou tout Israël.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Apre, li te estasyone Levit yo lakay SENYÈ a avèk senbal yo, avèk ap e avèk linstriman kòd yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:14">II Kwo 8:14</ref></char></note>selon kòmand David la avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:11">II Sam 24:11</ref></char></note>Gad, konseye wa a, ak Nathan, pwofèt la; paske kòmand lan te sòti nan SENYÈ a pa pwofèt li yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Levit yo te kanpe avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:5">I Kwo 23:5</ref></char></note>enstriman mizik a David yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:12">II Kwo 5:12</ref></char></note>prèt yo avèk twonpèt yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Ézéchias te bay lòd pou fè ofrann brile sou lotèl la. Lè ofrann brile yo te kòmanse, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:18">II Kwo 23:18</ref></char></note>chan SENYÈ a te kòmanse tou avèk twonpèt yo, avèk enstriman a David yo, wa Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Pandan tout asanble a t ap fè adorasyon, chantè yo osi t ap chante e twonpèt yo t ap sone; tout sa te kontinye jiskaske ofrann brile a te fini.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Alò, nan fen tout ofrann brile yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:18">II Kwo 20:18</ref></char></note>wa a avèk tout moun ki te prezan avèk li yo te bese ba pou te fè adorasyon. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Anplis, Wa Ézéchias avèk ofisye yo te kòmande Levit yo pou chante lwanj a SENYÈ a avèk pawòl a David yo, avèk Asaph, konseye a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 100:1">Sòm 100:1</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te chante lwanj avèk jwa e te bese ba pou te fè adorasyon.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Epi Ézéchias te di: “Koulye a, akoz nou te konsakre nou menm a SENYÈ a, vin pre pou pote sakrifis avèk ofrann remèsiman lakay SENYÈ a.” Epi asanble a te pote sakrifis yo avèk ofrann remèsiman yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 35:5-22">Egz 35:5-22</ref></char></note>Tout moun ki te vle, yo te pote ofrann brile. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Kantite a ofrann brile ke asanble a te pote yo te swasann-dis towo, san belye ak de-san jèn mouton. Tout sila yo te pou fè yon ofrann brile a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Bagay konsakre yo te sis-san towo ak twa-mil mouton. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Men prèt yo pa t ase e pou sa, yo pa t kapab kòche tout ofrann brile yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:11">II Kwo 35:11</ref></char></note>Konsa, frè yo nan Levit yo te ede yo jiskaske travay la te fini, e jiskaske lòt prèt yo te fin konsakre yo menm. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:3">II Kwo 30:3</ref></char></note>Levit yo te pi dedye pou konsakre yo menm pase prèt yo. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Te gen osi anpil ofrann brile avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 3:16">Lev 3:16</ref></char></note>grès a ofrann lapè yo, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:5-10">Nonb 15:5-10</ref></char></note>ofrann bwason pou ofrann brile yo. Konsa, sèvis lakay SENYÈ a te vin etabli ankò. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Epi Ézéchias avèk tout pèp la te rejwi sou sa ke Bondye te prepare pou pèp la, akoz bagay la te rive sibitman.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Alò, Ézéchias te voye kote tout Israël avèk Juda, e anplis, li te ekri lèt a Éphraïm avèk Manassé pou yo ta vini lakay SENYÈ a Jérusalem pou selebre Pak SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Paske wa a avèk chèf pa li yo ak tout asanble Jérusalem nan te pran desizyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:10-11">Nonb 9:10-11</ref></char></note>pou selebre Pak la nan dezyèm mwa a. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Yo fè sa akoz yo pa t ka selebre li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:17-34">II Kwo 29:17-34</ref></char></note>lè sa a, akoz prèt yo potko konsakre yo menm an kantite ase, ni pèp la potko rasanble Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Konsa, bagay la te kòrèk nan zye a wa a avèk tout asanble a. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Pou sa, yo te etabli yon dekrè pou sikile kòm yon pwoklamasyon pami tout Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:1">Jij 20:1</ref></char></note>soti nan Beer-Schéba jis rive menm nan Dan, pou yo ta kapab vin selebre Pak SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, Jérusalem. Paske yo pa t selebre li an gran nonb depi lè li te premye etabli a.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:25">Job 9:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mesaje yo te ale patou nan tout Israël avèk Juda avèk lèt soti nan men a wa a avèk chèf li yo menm, selon lòd a wa a. Yo te di: “O fis Israël yo, retounen kote SENYÈ a, Bondye Abraham nan, Isaac, avèk Israël la, pou Li kapab retounen kote sila nan nou ki fin chape e retire soti nan men a wa Asiryen yo. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:13">Éz 20:13</ref></char></note>Pa fè tankou papa zansèt nou yo avèk frè nou yo ki pa t fidèl a SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt yo, jiskaske li te fè yo parèt tankou yon laperèz etonan, jan nou wè a. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Alò, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:9">Egz 32:9</ref></char></note>fè tèt di tankou papa zansèt nou yo, men bay plas a SENYÈ a. Antre nan sanktyè ke Li te konsakre jis pou tout tan an, e sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pou kòlè Li k ap brile a kapab vire kite nou. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:2">Det 30:2</ref></char></note>si nou retounen kote SENYÈ a, frè nou yo avèk fis nou yo va jwenn mizerikòd devan sila ki te mennen yo an kaptivite yo, e yo va retounen nan peyi sa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">Egz 34:6-7</ref></char></note>Paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, plen gras avèk konpasyon e Li p ap vire fas Li kite nou si nou retounen kote Li.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Pou sa, mesaje yo te pase soti nan yon vil a yon lòt vil, toupatou nan peyi Éphraïm avèk Manassé, e soti rive Zabulon. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">II Kwo 36:16</ref></char></note> yo te fè grimas sou yo, yo te giyonnen yo, e moke yo. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:18-25">II Kwo 30:18-25</ref> </char></note>kèk nan mesye Aser yo, Manassé, avèk Zabulon yo te imilye yo, e yo te vini Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Anplis, men Bondye te sou Juda pou bay yo yon sèl kè pou fè sa ke wa a avèk chèf yo te kòmande yo a, pa pawòl SENYÈ a.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Alò, anpil moun te rasanble Jérusalem pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:2">II Kwo 30:2</ref></char></note>selebre Fèt Pen San Ledven an nan dezyèm mwa a, yon asanble ki te trè trè gran. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Yo te leve e te retire fo lotèl ki te Jérusalem yo. Anplis, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">II Kwo 28:24</ref></char></note>retire tout fo lotèl lansan yo e te jete yo nan flèv Cédron an. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:2-3">II Kwo 30:2-3</ref></char></note>yo te touye jèn mouton Pak yo nan katòzyèm jou nan dezyèm mwa a. Konsa, prèt yo avèk Levit yo te vin wont a yo menm, e te konsakre yo menm, e te pote ofrann brile yo lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:10-15">II Kwo 35:10-15</ref></char></note>Yo te kanpe nan estasyon pa yo selon koutim pa yo, selon lalwa Moïse la, nonm Bondye a. Prèt yo te aspèje san ke yo te resevwa nan men Levit yo. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Paske te gen anpil prèt nan asanble a ki pa t konsakre yo menm. Pou sa, Levit yo te responsab pou touye jèn mouton Pak yo ki te pou tout sila ki pa t pwòp yo, pou yo ta kapab vin konsakre yo a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Paske yon foul nan pèp la, menm anpil nan Éphraïm avèk Manassé, Issacar ak Zabulon pa t pirifye yo menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:10">Nonb 9:10</ref></char></note>sepandan yo te manje Pak la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:43-49">Egz 12:43-49</ref></char></note>yon lòt jan ke sa ki te premye etabli a. Paske Ézéchias te priye pou yo e te di: “Ke SENYÈ a kapab padone <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">II Kwo 19:3</ref></char></note>tout sila ki prepare kè yo pou chache Bondye, SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt li yo, malgre se pa selon règleman pou pirifikasyon nan sanktyè a.”<verse eid="2CH 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Pou sa, SENYÈ a te tande Ézéchias e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:16">Jc 5:16</ref></char></note>geri pèp la. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Fis a Israël ki te la Jérusalem yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:15">Egz 12:15</ref></char></note>selebre Fèt Pen San Ledven an pandan sèt jou avèk gran jwa, e Levit yo avèk prèt yo te louwe SENYÈ a, jou apre jou, avèk enstriman ki te fè gwo son a SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Epi Ézéchias te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:6">II Kwo 32:6</ref></char></note>pale ankourajman a tout Levit ki te montre gwo kapasite pou afè SENYÈ yo. Konsa, yo te manje pandan sèt jou ki te chwazi yo pandan yo t ap fè sakrifis ofrann lapè yo e t ap bay remèsiman a SENYÈ a, Bondye a papa zansèt yo a.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Anfen, tout asanble a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:65">I Wa 8:65</ref> </char></note>deside selebre yon lòt sèt jou ankò, e yo te selebre sèt jou yo avèk kè kontan. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:7-8">II Kwo 35:7-8</ref></char></note>Ézéchias, wa Juda a, te bay asanble a mil towo ak sèt-mil mouton; epi prens yo te bay yon mil towo ak di-mil mouton. Konsa, yon gran kantite nan prèt yo te konsakre yo menm. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Tout asanble Juda a te rejwi avèk prèt yo ak Levit yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:11-18">II Kwo 30:11-18</ref> </char></note>tout asanble ki te sòti an Israël la, ni vwayajè ki te sòti nan peyi Israël yo ansanm ak sila ki te rete Juda yo. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Konsa, te gen gwo lajwa Jérusalem, akoz pa t janm genyen yon bagay parèy a sa Jérusalem <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:8-10">II Kwo 7:8-10</ref></char></note>depi nan jou a Salomon yo, fis David la, wa Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Epi prèt Levit yo te leve pou te beni pèp la. Vwa yo te tande, e lapriyè yo te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:15">Det 26:15</ref></char></note>lye sen Li an, menm nan syèl la.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Alò, lè tout sa te fini, tout Israël ki te prezan te sòti antre nan vil Juda yo. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">II Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>kraze pilye Asherim yo an mòso, yo te koupe poto Asherim yo, e te rale fè desann wo plas yo avèk lotèl yo pami tout Juda avèk Benjamin e anplis, nan Éphraïm avèk Manassé, jiskaske yo te detwi yo tout. Epi tout fis Israël yo te retounen nan vil pa yo, yo chak nan posesyon pa yo.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Konsa, Ézéchias te apwente <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 24:1">I Kwo 24:1</ref></char></note>divizyon a prèt yo ak Levit yo pa divizyon pa yo, yo chak selon sèvis pa yo, prèt yo avèk Levit yo pou ofrann brile avèk ofrann lapè yo, pou fè sèvis e bay remèsiman avèk lwanj nan pòtay kan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Li te etabli osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:7">II Kwo 35:7</ref></char></note>pòsyon wa a nan byen pa li pou ofrann brile yo, pou ofrann maten avèk aswè a, ofrann brile pou Saba yo, pou nouvèl lin yo e pou fèt etabli yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:1-29">Nonb 28:1-29-40</ref></char></note>jan sa ekri nan lalwa SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Anplis, li te kòmande moun ki te rete Jérusalem yo pou bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:8">Nonb 18:8</ref></char></note>pòsyon ki te dwa a prèt yo avèk Levit yo, pou yo ta kapab dedye pwòp tèt yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:7">Mal 2:7</ref> </char></note>lalwa SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Depi lòd la te fin gaye, fis Israël yo te mete disponib an abondans, premye fwi nan sereyal yo, diven nèf, lwil, siwo myèl ak tout pwodwi chan an; epi yo te pote an abondans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:12">Né 13:12</ref></char></note>dim nan de tout bagay. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Fis a Israël avèk Juda ki te rete lavil Juda yo, anplis, te pote fè antre dim nan bèf avèk mouton yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref></char></note>dim nan don sen ki te konsakre a SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, e te plase yo nan gwo pil yo.<verse eid="2CH 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Nan twazyèm mwa a, yo te kòmanse fè pil yo e te fin fè yo nan setyèm mwa a. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Lè Ézéchias avèk chèf yo te vin wè gwo pil yo, yo te beni SENYÈ a avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:29">Det 33:29</ref></char></note>pèp Israël Li a. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Epi Ézéchias te kesyone prèt yo avèk Levit yo sou gwo pil yo. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Azaria, chèf prèt lakay Tsadok la te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref></char></note>“Depi don yo te kòmanse antre lakay SENYÈ a, nou te gen kont pou nou manje avèk anpil ki te rete, paske SENYÈ a te beni pèp Li a, e gran kantite sila a rete toujou.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Epi Ézéchias te kòmande yo pou prepare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:5-8">I Wa 6:5-8</ref></char></note>chanm lakay SENYÈ a e yo te prepare yo. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Yo te byen fidèl nan pote dim avèk ofrann avèk bagay konsakre yo. Epi Conania, Levit la, te ofisye an chaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:9">II Kwo 35:9</ref></char></note>sou yo, e frè l, Schimeï te dezyèm nan. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Jehiel, Azazia, Nachath, Asaël, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Éliel, Jismakia, Machath avèk Benaja te anplwaye anba direksyon Conania avèk frè l, Schimeï, selon chwa Wa Ézéchias yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:10">II Kwo 31:10</ref></char></note>Azaria te ofisye prensipal lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Koré, fis a Jimna a, Levit la, gadyen pòtay lès la, te chèf sou ofrann bòn volonte a Bondye yo, pou fè distribisyon don pou SENYÈ a avèk bagay ki sen pase tout lòt bagay yo. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Anba otorite li, te gen Éden, Minjamin, Josué, Schemaeja, Amaria ak Schecania, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:9-19">Jos 21:9-19</ref></char></note>vil prèt yo pou separe, fidèlman, bay frè pa yo pa divizyon yo, piti kon gran, <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />anplis de sa yo ki te sou chif zansèt yo, pou gason soti nan laj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:3">I Kwo 23:3</ref></char></note>trantan oswa plis yo—tout moun ki te antre lakay SENYÈ a kòm obligasyon chak jou yo—pou travay nan devwa yo selon divizyon yo; <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />ansanm ak prèt ki te anrejistre pa zansèt yo selon lakay papa zansèt pa yo, e Levit yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:24">I Kwo 23:24</ref></char></note>soti nan laj a ventan oswa plis, selon devwa yo ak divizyon yo. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Anrejistreman pa zansèt yo te kontwole tout timoun yo, madanm yo, fis yo ak fi yo, pou tout asanble a, paske yo te konsakre yo menm, fidèlman, nan sentete. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Anplis, pou fis a Aaron yo, prèt yo, ki te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:34">Lev 25:34</ref></char></note>teren patiraj lavil yo, oswa nan chak vil menm, te gen mesye ki te dezinye pa non pou fè distribisyon pòsyon a chak gason pami prèt yo e chak ki te anrejistre pa zansèt li yo pami Levit yo.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Konsa, Ézéchias te fè patou nan tout Juda; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:3">II Wa 20:3</ref></char></note>li te fè sa ki te bon e dwat devan SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Tout èv ke li te kòmanse fè nan sèvis lakay Bondye a, nan lalwa avèk kòmandman an, nan chache Bondye li a, li te fè yo avèk tout kè li, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:9">Det 29:9</ref></char></note>byen reyisi.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Apre zak fidelite sila yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:13-37">II Wa 18:13-37</ref></char></note>Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a, te vin atake Juda. Li te fè syèj a tout vil fòtifye yo, e li te fè plan pou pouse antre nan yo pou l domine yo pou kont li. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Alò, lè Ézéchias te wè ke Sanchérib te vini, e ke li te gen plan pou fè lagè sou Jérusalem, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />li te deside avèk ofisye pa li yo ak gèrye pa li yo, pou koupe kouran dlo ki te ale deyò lavil la, e yo te ede li. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Pou sa, anpil moun te rasanble e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">II Wa 20:20</ref></char></note>te bouche tout sous avèk flèv ki te kouri nan zòn nan. Konsa, yo te di: “Poukisa wa Asiryen yo ta dwe vini pou jwenn tout dlo sa a?”<verse eid="2CH 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Konsa, li te pran kouraj, e te rebati tout mi ki te kraze yo e te fè yo monte nan nivo tou li yo. Li te ranfòse<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref></char></note> lòt miray pa deyò pou te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:24">I Wa 9:24</ref></char></note>Millo lavil David la pi solid, e li te fè zam avèk boukliye defans an gran kantite. <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Li te chwazi chèf militè sou pèp la, e te rasanble yo kote li nan plas kote pòtay vil la. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:22">II Kwo 30:22</ref></char></note>pale pawòl ki pou ankouraje yo. Li te di: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Rete fò e pran kouraj, pa pè ni dekouraje akoz wa Assyrie a, ni tout gran foul ki avèk l; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:16">II Wa 6:16</ref></char></note>paske sila ki avèk nou an pi gran ke sila ki avè l. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Avèk li menm, se yon bra fèt an chè; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:17">II Kwo 20:17</ref></char></note>avèk nou, se SENYÈ Bondye pa nou an, pou ede nou goumen nan batay nou yo.” Konsa, pèp la te konte sou pawòl a Ézéchias yo, wa Juda a.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Apre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:17">II Wa 18:17</ref></char></note>Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a, te voye sèvitè li yo Jérusalem pandan li t ap fè syèj Lakis avèk tout lame li a avèk li kont Ézéchias, wa Juda a, e kont tout Juda ki Jérusalem yo. Li te di: <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />Konsa pale Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a: “Sou kilès n ap mete konfyans pou nou ta retire Jérusalem anba syèj? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Èske Ézéchias p ap egare nou pou fè nou vin mouri avèk grangou ak swaf, pandan l ap di: ‘SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, va delivre nou soti nan men a wa Assyrie a?’ <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:1">II Kwo 31:1</ref></char></note>Èske menm Ézéchias sa a pa t retire wo plas Li yo avèk lotèl Li yo, e te di a Juda avèk Jérusalem: ‘Nou va adore devan yon sèl lotèl e sou li, nou va brile lansan?’ <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Èske nou pa konnen sa mwen avèk zansèt mwen yo te fè a tout pèp nan lòt peyi yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:33-35">II Wa 18:33-35</ref></char></note>Èske dye nan nasyon yo te gen kapasite menm pou delivre peyi yo anba men mwen? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:9-11">És 10:9-11</ref></char></note>Kilès ki te gen pami tout dye a nasyon sila yo ke zansèt mwen yo pa t detwi nèt, ki ta kapab delivre pèp li a sòti nan men m pou Dye pa w la ta kapab delivre ou soti nan men m? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Alò, pou sa, pa kite Ézéchias pase nou nan tenten, ni egare nou konsa. Ni pa kwè li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 36:18-20">És 36:18-20</ref></char></note>pa t gen dye nan okenn nasyon oswa wayòm ki te konn delivre pèp li nan men m ni soti nan men a zansèt mwen yo. Konbyen an mwens Dye pa nou an va delivre nou soti nan men m?”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Sèvitè li yo te pale plis kont SENYÈ a, Bondye a, e kont sèvitè li a, Ézéchias. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Anplis, li te ekri lèt yo pou meprize SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, e pou pale kont Li, epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:14">II Kwo 32:14</ref></char></note>“Jan dye nasyon yo ak peyi yo pa t delivre pèp pa yo soti nan men m, konsa Bondye Ézéchias la p ap delivre pèp Li a soti nan men m.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Yo te kriye sa byen fò ak gwo vwa nan langaj a Juda, vè pèp Jérusalem ki te sou miray la, pou fè yo pè e teworize yo, pou yo ta kab pran vil la. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Yo te pale sou Bondye Jérusalem nan kòmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-8">Sòm 115:4-8</ref> </char></note> se youn nan dye a pèp lemond yo, zèv a men de lòm yo.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Men Wa Ézéchias avèk pwofèt Ésaïe, fis a Amots la, te fè lapriyè sou sa a, e te kriye fò anvè syèl la.<verse eid="2CH 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te voye yon zanj ki te detwi tout gwo gèrye, kòmandan ak chèf nan kan wa Assyrie a. Pou sa, li te retounen nan wont li ale nan pwòp peyi li. Epi lè li te antre nan tanp dye pa li a, kèk nan pwòp pitit pa li yo te touye li la avèk nepe. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:5">És 31:5</ref></char></note>sove Ézéchias avèk moun Jérusalem yo soti nan men a Sanchérib, wa Assyrie a, soti nan men a tout ènmi li yo, e te gide yo tout kote. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:10">II Sam 8:10</ref></char></note>anpil moun t ap pote don bay SENYÈ a Jérusalem ak kado byen chwazi a Ézéchias, wa Juda a, jis apre, li te fin egzalte nan men a tout nasyon yo.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">II Wa 20:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan jou sa yo, Ézéchias te vin malad jis rive pre lanmò. Li te priye a SENYÈ a. SENYÈ a te pale avèk li e te ba li yon sign. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Men Ézéchias pa t remèt anyen pou benefis li te resevwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16">II Kwo 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:18">II Kwo 24:18</ref></char></note>paske kè li te plen ògèy. Akoz sa, kòlè SENYÈ a te vini sou li avèk Juda ak Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Men Ézéchias te vin desann ògèy kè li a, ni li menm, ni pèp Jérusalem nan, jiskaske kòlè pa t rive sou yo pandan jou a Ézéchias yo.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Alò, Ézéchias te gen anpil richès avèk onè. Li te fè pou kont li trezò an ajan, lò, pyè presye, epis, boukliye defans ak tout kalite bagay ak gwo valè, <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />anplis, depo pou konsève sereyal, diven avèk lwil, pak pou tout kalite bèt, avèk pak pou bann yo. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Li te fè vil pou li menm, e te vin genyen bann mouton avèk twoupo an gran kantite, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:12">I Kwo 29:12</ref></char></note>Bondye te ba li anpil richès. <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Se te Ézéchias ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">II Wa 20:20</ref></char></note>bouche sous piwo dlo Guihon yo, e te dirije yo rive nan pati lwès lavil David la. Ézéchias te byen reyisi nan tout sa li te fè.<verse eid="2CH 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Men nan afè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">II Wa 20:20</ref></char></note>mesaje ki sòti Babylone yo, ki te voye bò kote li pou aprann tout mèvèy ki te fèt nan peyi a, Bondye te kite li, pou L ta ka pase l nan eprèv pou wè tout sa ki te nan kè l.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Alò, tout lòt zèv Ézéchias yo avèk zèv fidèl li yo, vwala, yo ekri nan vizyon Ésaïe, pwofèt la, fis a Amots la, nan Liv A Wa Juda Avèk Israël Yo. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Konsa, Ézéchias te dòmi avèk papa zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li nan chemen an ki monte kote tonm fis a David yo. Tout Juda avèk pèp Jérusalem nan te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:6">Sòm 112:6</ref></char></note>onore li nan lanmò li. Fis li a, Manassé te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">II Wa 21:1-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Manassé te gen laj douzan lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye pandan senkann-senkan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">II Kwo 28:3</ref></char></note>Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a, selon abominasyon yo a nasyon an ke SENYÈ a te chase deyò devan fis Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:1">II Kwo 31:1</ref></char></note>li te rebati wo plas ke Ézéchias, papa li te kraze yo. Anplis, li te monte lotèl pou Baal yo. Li te fè Asherim yo, e li te adore tout lame syèl yo e te sèvi yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:24">II Kwo 28:24</ref> </char></note>Li te bati lotèl lakay SENYÈ a sou sila yo SENYÈ a te di: “Se non Mwen k ap nan Jérusalem jis pou tout tan an.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Paske li te bati lotèl pou tout lame syèl yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:9">II Kwo 4:9</ref></char></note>de lakou lakay SENYÈ yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:3">II Kwo 28:3</ref></char></note>Anplis, li te fè fis li yo pase nan dife nan vale Ben-Hinnom, epi li te pratike vye maji, divinasyon, fè wanga e li te fè angajman avèk sila ki pale ak mò yo ak divinò yo. Li te fè anpil mal nan zye SENYÈ a ki te pwovoke Li a lakòlè. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Li te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:15">II Kwo 33:15</ref></char></note>imaj taye ke li te fè lakay Bondye a, sou sila Bondye te di a David ak Salomon, fis li a: “Nan kay sila a ak nan Jérusalem, ke Mwen te chwazi soti nan tout tribi Israël yo, Mwen va mete non Mwen jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Mwen p ap retire ankò pye Israël soti nan peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:10">II Sam 7:10</ref> </char></note>ke Mwen te chwazi pou papa zansèt nou yo, si sèlman yo va obsève pou fè tout sa ke M te kòmande yo pa tout lalwa, règleman avèk òdonans ki te bay pa Moïse yo.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Konsa, Manassé te egare Juda ak pèp Jérusalem nan pou fè plis mal pase menm nasyon ke SENYÈ a te detwi devan fis Israël yo.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />SENYÈ a te pale ak Manassé avèk pèp li a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:29">Né 9:29</ref></char></note>yo pa t okipe sa menm. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Pou sa, SENYÈ a te fè chèf a lame wa Assyrie yo vin parèt kont yo. Yo te kaptire Manassé e te mete l an chenn yo. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:6">II Kwo 36:6</ref></char></note>mete chenn an bwonz sou pye l, e te mennen li Babylone.<verse eid="2CH 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 130:1-2">Sòm 130:1-2</ref></char></note>li te nan gwo twoub, li te sipliye SENYÈ a, Bondye pa li a, devan Bondye a zansèt li yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Lè li te priye a Li menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:20">I Kwo 5:20</ref></char></note>Li te touche pa priyè li a. Konsa, Li te tande siplikasyon li an, e te mennen li ankò Jérusalem kote wayòm li an. Konsa, Manassé te konnen ke SENYÈ a te Bondye.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Alò, apre sa li te bati miray deyò lavil David la sou kote lwès a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:33">I Wa 1:33</ref></char></note>Guihon, nan vale a, menm pou rive nan antre Pòtay Pwason an. Li te antoure Ophel la avèk li, e te fè li byen wo, epi li te mete chèf lame yo nan tout vil fòtifye Juda yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Anplis, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:3-7">II Kwo 33:3-7</ref></char></note>retire dye etranje yo avèk zidòl yo soti lakay SENYÈ a. Tout lotèl ke li te bati sou mòn lakay SENYÈ a ak nan Jérusalem yo, li te jete yo deyò lavil la. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Li te monte lotèl SENYÈ a, e te fè sakrifis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:11-18">Lev 7:11-18</ref></char></note>ofrann lapè avèk ofrann remèsiman sou li; epi li te kòmande Juda pou sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:12">II Kwo 32:12</ref></char></note>pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis nan lye wo yo, men sèlman a SENYÈ Bondye pa yo a.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Alò, tout lòt zèv Manassé yo, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:12-13">II Kwo 33:12-13</ref></char></note>lapriyè li a Bondye pa li a, ak pawòl a divinè yo ki te pale avèk li nan non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, men gade, yo pami achiv a wa Israël yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Anplis lapriyè li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:13">II Kwo 33:13</ref></char></note> jan li te sipliye Bondye a, ak tout peche li yo, enfidelite li ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:3">II Kwo 33:3</ref></char></note>landwa ke li te bati wo plas pou te fè monte Asherim yo, ak imaj taye yo, avan li te vin imilye li menm, gade, yo tout ekri nan achiv a Hozaï yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Konsa, Manassé te dòmi avèk papa zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li nan pwòp kay li. Epi Amon, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:19-24">II Wa 21:19-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amon te gen laj a venn-dezan lè l te devni wa, e li te renye dezan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a tankou Manassé, papa li, te konn fè a, e Amon te fè sakrifis a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:3-4">II Kwo 34:3-4</ref></char></note>imaj taye ke papa li, Manassé te fè yo, e li te sèvi yo. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Anplis, li pa t imilye li menm devan SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:12">II Kwo 33:12</ref></char></note>jan papa li, Manassé te fè a, men Amon te ogmante koupabilite li. <verse eid="2CH 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Anfen, sèvitè li yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:27">II Kwo 25:27</ref></char></note>fè konplo kont li, e te mete li a lanmò nan pwòp kay pa li. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Men pèp peyi a te touye tout sila ki te fè konplo a kont Wa Amon yo, e pèp peyi a te fè Josias, fis li a, wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">II Wa 22:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Josias te gen laj a uitan lè l te devni wa a, e li te renye tran-te-yen nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:2">II Kwo 29:2</ref></char></note>Li te fè sa ki bon nan zye SENYÈ a. Li te mache nan chemen a David, papa zansèt pa li a e li pa t vire akote ni adwat ni agoch. <verse eid="2CH 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Paske nan uityèm ane règn pa li a, pandan li te toujou nan jenès li, li te kòmanse chache Bondye a papa zansèt li a, David. Epi nan douzyèm ane a, li te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">I Wa 13:2</ref></char></note>pirifye Juda avèk Jérusalem sou afè a wo plas yo, Asherim nan, imaj taye yo ak imaj fonn yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Yo te chire desann lotèl Baal yo nan prezans li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:4-11">II Wa 23:4-11</ref></char></note>lotèl lansan ki te byen wo sou yo, li te koupe yo desann. Anplis, Asherim yo, imaj taye yo ak imaj fonn yo, li te kase yo an mòso, kraze yo fè poud e li te gaye l sou tonm a sila ki te fè sakrifis a yo menm yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">I Wa 13:2</ref></char></note>Li te brile zo a prèt Baal yo sou lotèl la, e li te pirifye Juda avèk Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:15-19">II Kwo 23:15-19</ref></char></note>Nan vil a Manassé yo, Éphraïm, Siméon, jis rive Nephthali, nan mazi kraze yo, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />li te osi chire fè desann lotèl yo. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:1">II Kwo 31:1</ref></char></note>kraze Asherim avèk imaj taye yo jiskaske yo te fè poud, e te koupe desann lotèl lansan yo toupatou nan peyi Israël la. Anfen, li te retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">II Wa 22:3-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan di-zuityèm ane règn li a, lè li te fin pirifye peyi a avèk kay la, li te voye Schaphan, fis a Atsalia a avèk Maaséja, yon ofisye lavil la ak Joach, fis a Joachaz la, grefye a, pou repare lakay SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Yo te vin kote Hilkaja, wo prèt la, e yo te livre li lajan ki te pote lakay Bondye a, ke Levit yo, gadyen pòtay yo, te kolekte soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:10-18">II Kwo 30:10-18</ref></char></note>Manassé, Éphraïm, de tout retay Israël yo, e soti nan tout Juda avèk Benjamin ak pèp Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Yo te ba li nan men a ouvriye ki te sipèvize lakay SENYÈ a, epi ouvriye ki t ap travay lakay SENYÈ a te sèvi ak li pou restore e repare kay la. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Yo menm, te remèt li a chapant avèk mason yo pou achte wòch taye avèk gwo bwa pou travès ak bwa mare pou kay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:4-7">II Kwo 33:4-7</ref></char></note>ke wa nan Juda yo te kite detwi yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:15">II Wa 12:15</ref></char></note>Mesye yo te fè travay la avèk bòn fwa ak fòmann ki sou yo pou sipèvize yo. Yo te sipèrvize pa Jachath avèk Abidias, Levit yo nan fis a Merari yo, Zacharie avèk Meschallam nan fis a Keatit yo ak Levit yo, tout moun ki te gen gwo kapasite, ak lòt ki te fò nan jwe enstriman mizik yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />Anplis, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:10">Né 4:10</ref></char></note>sou sila ki t ap pote chaj yo, e yo te sipèvize tout ouvriye soti de yon tach a yon lòt. Pami Levit yo te gen skrib, ofisye ak sipèvizè.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Lè yo t ap pote fè sòti lajan ki te antre lakay SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:9">II Kwo 34:9</ref></char></note>Hilkija, prèt la, te twouve liv lalwa SENYÈ a ki te bay pa Moïse la. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilkija te reponn e te di a Schaphan, sekretè a: “Mwen te twouve liv lalwa lakay SENYÈ a.” Epi Hilkija te bay liv la a Schaphan.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Konsa, Schaphan te pote liv la kote wa a, e te bay yon rapò anplis a wa a. Li te di: “Tout sa ou te konfye a sèvitè ou yo, y ap fè l. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Yo deja retire lajan yo te twouve lakay SENYÈ a, e te livre li nan men a sipèvizè yo ak ouvriye yo.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Anplis, Schaphan, sekretè a te di wa a, “Hilkija, prèt la, te ban mwen yon liv.” Epi Schaphan te li ladann nan, nan prezans a wa a.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Lè wa a te tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:3-68">Det 28:3-68</ref> </char></note>pawòl lalwa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:6">Jos 7:6</ref></char></note>li te chire rad li. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Epi wa a te kòmande Hilkija, Achikam, fis a Schaphan nan, Abdon, fis Michée a, Schaphan, sekretè a ak Asaja, sèvitè a wa a e te di: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Ale fè ankèt a SENYÈ a pou mwen e pou sila ki rete Israël avèk Juda yo, konsènan pawòl a liv ki te twouve a; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:8">II Kwo 29:8</ref></char></note>byen gwo, se kòlè SENYÈ a ki vide sou nou akoz papa zansèt nou yo pa t obsève pawòl a SENYÈ a, pou fè selon tout sa ki ekri nan liv sila a.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Konsa, Hilkija avèk sila ke wa a te pale yo te ale kote Hulda, pwofetès la, madanm a Schallum nan, fis a Thokehath la, fis a Hasra a, gadyen vètman yo, (alò, li te rete Jérusalem nan dezyèm katye); epi yo te pale avèk li konsa.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Li te di yo: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Di nonm ki te voye nou kote mwen an, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />Konsa pale SENYÈ a: Veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:14-20">II Kwo 36:14-20</ref></char></note>Mwen ap voye malè sou plas sa a ak sou pèp li a, menm tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Det 28:15-68</ref></char></note>malediksyon ki ekri nan liv ke yo te li nan prezans a wa Juda a. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Akoz yo te abandone Mwen, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:3">II Kwo 33:3</ref></char></note>te brile lansan a lòt dye yo, pou yo ta kapab pwovoke Mwen a lakòlè avèk tout zèv a men yo; pou sa, kòlè Mwen va vin vide sou plas sa a e li p ap etenn.’”’<verse eid="2CH 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />“Men pou wa Juda ki te voye nou fè ankèt devan SENYÈ a, konsa nou va pale a li: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la selon pawòl ke ou te tande yo, <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:19">II Wa 22:19</ref></char></note>akoz kè ou te mou e ou te imilye ou menm devan Bondye lè ou te tande pawòl Li yo kont plas sa a, e kont pèp li a, akoz ou te imilye ou menm devan Mwen, ou te chire vètman ou e ou te kriye devan M, Mwen anverite te tande ou’, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Tande byen, Mwen va ranmase ou a papa zansèt ou yo, e ou va ranmase a tonm ou an anpè, pou zye ou pa wè tout malè ke Mwen va pote sou plas sa a avèk pèp li a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Yo te pote bay wa a mesaj sila a.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:1-3">II Wa 23:1-3</ref></char></note>wa a te voye rasanble tout ansyen a Juda avèk Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Wa a te monte vè lakay SENYÈ a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:1-3">Né 8:1-3</ref></char></note>tout mesye Juda yo, pèp Jérusalem nan, prèt yo, Levit yo, e tout moun soti nan pi gran jis rive nan pi piti yo—epi li te li nan zòrèy yo, tout pawòl liv akò ki te twouve lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Wa a te kanpe nan plas li a, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:16">II Kwo 23:16</ref></char></note>fè yon akò devan SENYÈ a pou mache nan chemen SENYÈ a, pou kenbe kòmandman Li yo avèk temwayaj Li yo, avèk règleman Li yo avèk tout kè li ak tout nanm li, pou reyisi fè tout pawòl a akò ki ekri nan liv sila yo. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Anplis, li te fè tout moun ki te prezan Jérusalem avèk Benjamin yo kanpe avèk li. Konsa, pèp Jérusalem la te fè selon akò Bondye a, Bondye a papa zansèt yo a. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Josias te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:3-7">II Kwo 34:3-7</ref></char></note>retire tout abominasyon soti nan tout peyi ki te apatyen a fis Israël yo e te fè tout moun ki te prezan an Israël yo sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a. Pandan tout lavi li, yo pa t detounen nan swiv SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Epi Josias te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:21">II Wa 23:21</ref></char></note>selebre fèt Pak a SENYÈ a Jérusalem. Yo te touye bèt pou Pak la sou katòzyèm jou nan premye mwa a. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Li te plase prèt yo nan pozisyon pa yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:11">II Kwo 29:11</ref></char></note>ankouraje yo nan sèvis lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Anplis, li te di a Levit ki te enstwi tout Israël yo, e ki te sen a SENYÈ a: “Mete lach SENYÈ a nan kay ke Salomon, fis a David la, wa Israël la, te bati a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 23:26">I Kwo 23:26</ref></char></note>Li p ap ankò yon chaj sou zepòl nou. Alò, koulye a sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, avèk pèp Li a, Israël. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:10-13">I Kwo 9:10-13</ref></char></note>Prepare nou menm selon lakay papa zansèt nou yo nan divizyon nou yo selon ekriti a David la, wa Israël la e selon ekriti a fis li a, Salomon. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:18">Esd 6:18</ref></char></note>kanpe nan lye sen an selon divizyon lakay papa zansèt nou yo ak frè nou yo ak selon Levit yo, pa divizyon lakay papa zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Alò, touye bèt Pak la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:5">II Kwo 29:5</ref></char></note>sanktifye nou e prepare pou frè nou yo pou fè selon pawòl SENYÈ a, selon Moïse.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Josias te fè kontribisyon pou pèp la, tout sa ki te prezan, bann jenn mouton yo ak jenn kabrit yo, tout pou ofrann Pak la, an kantite trant-mil, plis twa-mil towo. Sila yo te sòti nan byen ki te pou wa a. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Anplis, ofisye pa li yo te fè kontribisyon a yon ofrann bòn volonte a pèp la, prèt yo avèk Levit yo. Hilkija, Zacharie, avèk Jehiel, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 31:13">II Kwo 31:13</ref></char></note>chèf lakay Bondye yo, te bay a prèt yo pou Pak la, yon ofrann de-mil-sis-san bèt ki sòti nan bann mouton yo, avèk twa-san towo. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Conania osi avèk Schemaeja ak Nethaneel, frè li yo, Haschabia, Jeïel avèk Jozabad, ofisye Levit yo, te kontribye a Levit yo pou ofrann Pak la, senk-mil ki sòti nan bann mouton an ak senk-san towo.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Pou sa, sèvis la te fin prepare e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:5">II Kwo 35:5</ref></char></note>prèt yo te kanpe nan estasyon pa yo avèk Levit yo nan divizyon pa yo selon lòd a wa a. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Yo te touye bèt Pak yo e pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:22">II Kwo 29:22</ref></char></note>prèt yo t ap aspèje san ki te resevwa soti nan men Levit yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:34">II Kwo 29:34</ref></char></note> epi Levit yo t ap retire pwal yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Yo te retire ofrann brile yo pou yo ta kab bay yo selon divizyon lakay papa zansèt yo pou pèp la pou prezante a SENYÈ a jan sa ekri nan liv Moïse la. Yo te fè sa tou avèk towo yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:8-9">Egz 12:8-9</ref></char></note>yo te boukannen bèt Pak yo, sou dife selon règleman an, yo te bouyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:28">Lev 6:28</ref></char></note>bagay sen yo nan bonm, chodyè ak nan kaswòl e yo te pote yo avèk vitès a tout pèp òdinè yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Apre yo te prepare pou yo menm e pou prèt yo, akoz prèt yo, fis a Aaron yo t ap ofri ofrann brile avèk grès jis rive nan aswè. Pou sa, Levit yo te prepare pou yo menm ak pou prèt yo, fis a Aaron yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Anplis, chantè yo, fis a Asaph yo te nan estasyon pa yo selon kòmand a David la, Asaph, Héman, avèk Jeudthun, konseye a wa a; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:12-19">I Kwo 26:12-19</ref></char></note>gadyen pòtay te nan chak pòtay. Yo pa t oblije sòti nan sèvis pa yo akoz frè yo te prepare pou yo.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Konsa, tout sèvis SENYÈ a te prepare nan jou sa a pou selebre Pak la e pou ofri ofrann brile yo sou lotèl SENYÈ a selon kòmand a Wa Josias la. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Egz 12:1-20</ref></char></note>Fis Israël ki te prezan yo te selebre Pak la nan lè sa a ak Fèt Pen San Ledven an pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:21">II Wa 23:21</ref></char></note>Pa t janm gen yon selebrasyon Pak tankou sa an Israël depi jou a Samuel yo, pwofèt la. Ni pa te gen okenn nan wa Israël yo ki te selebre yon Pak jan Josias te fè avèk prèt yo, Levit yo, tout Juda, Israël ki te prezan yo ak pèp Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Se te nan uityèm ane règn Josias la, ke Pak sa a te selebre.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:29-30">II Wa 23:29-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apre tout sa, lè Josias te mete tanp lan an lòd, Néco, wa Egypte la, te vin monte pou fè lagè Carkemisch, sou rivyè Euphrate la, e Josias te parèt deyò pou rankontre li. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Men Néco te voye mesaje yo kote li. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:19">II Kwo 25:19</ref></char></note>“Kisa nou gen pou fè youn avèk lòt, O Wa Juda a? Se pa kont ou ke m ap vini jodi a, men kont kay avèk sila mwen angaje nan lagè yo. Bondye te kòmande mwen fè prese. Byen avèti ke se Bondye ki avè m nan, pou Li pa detwi ou.”<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Sepandan, Josias te refize vire kite li, men li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:29">II Kwo 18:29</ref></char></note>kache idantite li pou l ta kab fè lagè avèk li. Li pa t koute pawòl a Néco ki soti nan bouch Bondye a, men li te vin fè lagè sou plèn Méguiddo a. <verse eid="2CH 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Achè yo te tire Wa Josias, e wa a te di a sèvitè li yo: “Ale avè m, sòti, paske mwen blese byen grav.”<verse eid="2CH 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Pou sa, sèvitè li yo te retire li nan cha a, e yo te pote li nan dezyèm cha li te genyen an. Yo te mennen li Jérusalem kote li te mouri, e li te antere nan tonm a papa zansèt li yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Za 12:11</ref></char></note>Tout Juda avèk Jérusalem te kriye pou Josias. <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:10">Jr 22:10</ref></char></note>Jérémie te chante yon lamantasyon pou Josias. Epi tout chantè yo, ni gason, ni fanm pale sou Josias nan lamantasyon yo jis rive jodi a. Konsa, yo te fè avèk yo yon òdonans an Israël. Men gade, yo ekri nan Lamantasyon yo. <verse eid="2CH 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Alò, tout lòt zèv a Josias yo avèk zèv fidelite pa li yo, jan sa ki ekri nan lalwa SENYÈ yo, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />ak zèv li yo, soti nan premye a jis rive nan dènye a, men vwala, yo ekri nan Liv Wa A Israël Avèk Juda yo.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:30-34">II Wa 23:30-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, pèp peyi a te pran Joachaz, fis Josias la, e yo te fè li wa nan plas papa li Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Joachaz te gen venn-twazan lè l te vin wa, e li te renye twa mwa Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Epi wa Egypte la te retire li sou pouvwa a Jérusalem, e li te egzije yon kontribisyon de san talan ajan ak yon talan lò sou peyi a. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Wa Egypte la te fè Éliakim, frè l la, wa sou Juda avèk Jérusalem, e li te chanje non li an Jojakim. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:10-12">Jr 22:10-12</ref></char></note>Néco te pran frè li a, Joachaz e te mennen li an Égypte.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:36-37">II Wa 23:36-37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jojakim te gen laj a venn-senkan lè l te devni wa e li te renye onzan Jérusalem. Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te monte kont li, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:11">II Kwo 33:11</ref></char></note>mare li avèk chenn an bwonz pou mennen li Babylone. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">II Wa 24:13</ref></char></note>Nebucadnetsar te mennen kèk nan bagay ki sòti lakay SENYÈ a Babylone, e te mete yo nan tanp Babylone nan. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jojakim yo avèk abominasyon ke li te fè yo, ak sa ki te twouve kont li yo, men vwala, yo ekri nan Liv A Wa A Israël Avèk Juda yo. Epi Jojakin, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">II Wa 24:8-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jojakin te gen laj a uitan lè l te vin wa, e li te renye twa mwa avèk dis jou Jérusalem. Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Nan kòmansman ane a, Wa Nebucadnetsar te mennen li Babylone avèk bagay byen chè ki te sòti lakay SENYÈ a. Li te fè moun fanmi li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:1">Jr 37:1</ref></char></note>Sédécias, wa sou Juda avèk Jérusalem.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">II Wa 24:18-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sédécias te gen laj a ven-te-yen nan lè l te vin wa e li te renye pandan onzan Jérusalem. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Li te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a, Bondye li a. Li pa t imilye li menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 21:3-7">Jr 21:3-7</ref></char></note>devan Jérémie, pwofèt ki te pale pou SENYÈ a. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:3">Jr 52:3</ref></char></note>Anplis, li te fè rebèl kont Wa Nebucadnetsar ki te fè li sèmante fidelite pou Bondye. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:8">II Kwo 30:8</ref></char></note>li te fè tèt di, e avèk kè di, li te refize vire vè SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Epi, ofisye a prèt yo avèk pèp la te manke fidèl anpil nan swiv tout abominasyon a nasyon yo, e yo te konwonpi kay ke SENYÈ a te fè sen Jérusalem nan.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt pa yo a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:13">Jr 7:13</ref></char></note>voye kote yo tout tan pa mesaje pa Li yo, akoz li te gen mizerikòd vè pèp li a ak sou kote ke Li te abite a; <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:10">II Kwo 30:10</ref></char></note>giyonnen mesaje Bondye yo, yo te meprize pawòl Li, e yo te moke pwofèt Li yo, jiskaske kòlè SENYÈ a te leve kont pèp Li a jiskaske pa t gen remèd pou sa.<verse eid="2CH 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:1-7">II Wa 25:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Akoz sa, Li te mennen kont yo wa a Kaldeyen yo ki te touye jennonm yo avèk nepe nan kay sanktyè yo a, e Li pa t fè gras pou jèn moun, ni vyèj, ni granmoun, ni moun enfim. Li te livre tout nan men li. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:7-10">II Kwo 36:7-10</ref></char></note>Tout bagay ki te sòti lakay SENYÈ a, gran kon piti, trezò lakay SENYÈ a ak trezò a wa yo avèk ofisye li yo, li te mennen tout Babylone. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Anfen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:8">I Wa 9:8</ref></char></note>yo te brile kay Bondye a, yo te kraze miray Jérusalem nan, yo te brile tout konstriksyon fòtifye li yo avèk dife, e yo te detwi tout bagay valab li yo. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Sila ki te chape anba nepe yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:11">II Wa 25:11</ref></char></note>pote yo ale Babylone; epi yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 27:7">Jr 27:7</ref></char></note>sèvitè li avèk fis li jiskaske wayòm Perse la te vin monte. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Sa te fèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:10">Jr 29:10</ref></char></note>pou fin akonpli pawòl SENYÈ a pa bouch a Jérémie, jiskaske tè a te fin rejwi de tout Saba li yo. Pandan tout jou dezolasyon li yo, li te kenbe Saba a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jr 25:11</ref></char></note>jiskaske swasann-dizan an te fin pase.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Alò, nan premye ane Cyrus la, Perse la—-pou l te kab akonpli pawòl SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:12">Jr 25:12</ref></char></note>pa bouch Jérémie——SENYÈ a te boulvèse lespri a Cyrus, wa Perse la, pou li ta voye yon pwoklamasyon toupatou nan wayòm li an e anplis, ekri li pou di: <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />Konsa pale Cyrus, wa Perse la: “SENYÈ a, Bondye Syèl la, te ban mwen tout wayòm yo sou latè, e Li te mete m anba lòd pou bati pou Li yon kay Jérusalem, ki nan Juda. Ke SENYÈ a, Bondye pa li a, kapab avèk li e kite li monte.”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>